<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version WALAMTSI</book>
  <para style="toc3">Lamts</para>
  <para style="toc2">Walamtsi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Walamtsi</para>
  <para style="mt1">WALAMTSI</para>
  <para style="imt">ICHILONGOLE</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu cha Walamtsi chosimulila ghamatsuwa aghala Waisiraeli hawengile kuiboka na kuisola isi ya Kanaani. Matsuwa agho Waisiraeli wang'ali wakuyila kuyila ukumlema Imulungu, naye Imulungu ng'epfile baye ukuwakombola Waisiraeli ahala hawamlemile. Waisiraeli tsawanza kuitambikila milungu ingi, apfo Imulungu kawaghala iwanu wa isi tsingi watse kuwadununza. Kuya Waisiraeli wang'ali womlilila Imulungu naye Imulungu yang'ali yohulika chililo chawo na kuwoyila. Apfo Imulungu yang'ali yowaghalila pfilongotsi iwakemighwe Walamtsi, awo tsawawalongotsa na wawakombola Waisiraeli kulawa kwa iwanu iwawadununze.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kuduhu munu iyammanyile imunu iyandike ichitabu achino. Wanu wengi wa ghumwande walonga iyandike ichitabu achino tsa Samweli. Lekeni twodaha kutoghola ghendo ka ichitabu achino chandikighwa mna ghamatsuwa aghala Waisiraeli hawakalile wotawalighwa na mfalume, kwaapfila ichitabu chenyegho cholonga ghendo ka kuna matsuwa Waisiraeli tsawakala wahela imfalume (17.6, 18.1, 19.1, and 21.25).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ka Waisiraeli tsawalawa mna isi ya Misiri mna miyaka ya 1,400 KK, apfo aghala ighatendeke mna ichitabu achino cha Walamtsi ghandikighwa mna miyaka ya 1300 KK mbaka 1050 KK mna ghamatsuwa ghayatawale mfalume Sauli.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 1 mbaka 3.6 yotusimulila Waisiraeli pfawetowile na iwanu wa Kanaani ahala hayafile Joshuwa. Pfipfila yotusimulila ghamatsuwa gha walamtsi ahala Imulungu hayawaghalile pfilongotsi wailongotse na kuikombola Isiraeli.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 3.7 mbaka 16.31 yotulongela apfila Imulungu pfayawaghalile walamtsi kuwapfila Waisiraeli. Isula ya 3.7 mbaka 16.31</para>
  <para style="io">Isula 17 mbaka 21 yotupetela apfila Waisiraeli pfawaghendelele ukumlema Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="io">Ichitabu achino chomalitsila kwa kutulongela ka Waisiraeli wang'ali wombama imfalume iyompfuka Imulungu iyatsowalongotsa mna ukutenda ighanoghile kubita kuwa na pfilongotsi iwatendile aghala ighawonile ka ghanogha.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli wowatowa Wakanaani iwasighale waghima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Yoshuwa hayafile, Waisiraeli wamghutsa IMNDEWA, “Kabila lyachi litsolongola kughenda kuwatowa Wakanaani?”<verse eid="JDG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />IMNDEWA kawedika, “Likabila lya Yuda litsolongola, kwaapfila niweng'a isi ayo ya Wakanaani mmoko mwawo”. <verse eid="JDG 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Iwanu wa Yuda wawalongela ndughu tsawo, iwanu wa Simeoni, “Mwilongotse na twetwe hatughenda kuisola isi ayo yatwing'ighwe, twihangile ukuwatowa Wakanaani, na twetwe tutsomwapfilani hamghenda kuisola isi yamwing'ighwe iwe yenu”. Apfo Wasimeoni watoghola na waghenda hamwe nawo.<verse eid="JDG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Iwanu wa likabila lya Yuda waghenda kuwatowa Wakanaani na Waperizi, naye IMNDEWA kawapfila, kawatenda wawahume, nawo wawakoma wamale elufu kumi kuna ghumji ghwa Bezeki. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Kuko Bezeki wampfika mfalume Adoni Bezeki, wetowa naye, nawo wawatowa Wakanaani na Waperizi. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Lekeni Adoni Bezeki katsuma, nawo wamuwinga mbaka wamghogha, wamdumla ipfidole ghumba ipfili mmoko na mmaghulu. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Adoni Bezeki kalonga, “Wafalume sabini yaniwadumule ipfidole ghumba pfili mmoko na mmaghulu tsawang'ali wodondola ipfijo ipfilaghale mmetsa mwangu, lelo Imulungu kaniliha chichila chanendile nene.” Wamghala Yerusalemu, naye kafila kuko.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayuda woisola Yerusalemu, Heburoni na miji ingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Kuya iwanu wa Yuda wawatowa iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu na waghusola ghumji aghwo, wawakoma iwanu wake kwa mimaghe, kuya ghumji aghwo waghulakatsa kwa moto. <verse eid="JDG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Hambele, iwanu wa kabila lya Yuda waghenda kwitowa na Wakanaani iwakalile mna isi ya ipfidunda, na mna isi ya Negebu, na mna isi ya ichiwala. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Pfipfila iwanu wa likabila lya Yuda wawatowa Wakanaani iwang'ali wokala Heburoni, aho ghumwande ghumji agho tsaghumanyika ka Kiriati Ariba, nawo wawatowa mfalume Sheshai, mfalume Ahimani, na mfalume Talimai.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Kulawa kuko waghenda kuwatowa iwanu iwang'ali wokala Debiri, aho ghumwande ghumji aghwo tsaghumanyika ka Kiriati Seferi. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Kalebu kalonga, “Munu wowose iyatsodaha kughutowa ghumji ghwa Kiriati Seferi na kughusola, nitsomwing'a imwanangu Akisa yawe mwehe wake.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Naye Otinieli, imwana wa Kenazi, mdodo wake Kalebu, kaghusola ghumji agho, apfo Kalebu kamlapfa imwanaghe Akisa yakwelighwe na Otinieli. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Akisa hayakwelighwe na Otinieli, tsuwa limwe kamlongela Otinieli, “Ulombe mghunda kwa aba wangu.” Akisa tsakadina chihongwe, na hayahulumke hasi Kalebu kamghutsa, “Ubama nikwing'e choni?”<verse eid="JDG 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Naye kamwidika kalonga, “Ungaye nzawadi! Kwaapfila ghweghwe kunyika mna isi ya Negebu ili hela matsi, nokulomba lelo ungaye isi ina tsimbwibwi tsa ghamatsi.” Naye Kalebu kamwing'a tsimbwibwi tsa ghamatsi atsila itsili kuchanya, na atsila itsili kuisi.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Nawo iwatsukulu wa Keni, iyakalile aba mkwe wake Musa, tsawagheluka kulawa hana ghumji ghwa imitende, ighukemighwe Yeriko, hamwe na iwanu wa likabila lya Yuda, wengila mna inyika ya Yuda, ili kusini habehi na isi ya Aradi, nawo wakala hamwe nawo. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Kuya iwanu awano wa Yuda tsawelongotsa na ndughu tsawo, iwanu wa Simeoni, na wawatowa Wakanaani iwang'ali wokala Sefati, waghuhinya ghendo ghumji aghwo, apfo litaghwa lyake ghumji aghwo waghukema Horima. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Pfipfila iwanu wa kabila lya Yuda tsawaghusola ghumji ghwa Gaza na ghumji ghwa Ashikeloni na ghumji ghwa Ekironi na pfijiji pfose ipfitsunguluke imiji ayo.<verse eid="JDG 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />IMNDEWA tsakawapfila iwanu wa kabila lya Yuda, nawo wawawinga iwanu iwang'ali wokala mna isi ya ipfidunda, lekeni ng'awadahile baye ukuwawinga iwanu iwakalile mchiwala, kwaapfila mituka yawo ya ukwitowela ng'ondo tsa ya chuma.<verse eid="JDG 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Kuya Kalebu keng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Heburoni, ka pfayalongile Musa, naye kawawinga iwana awala wadatu wa Anaki iwakalile mumo.<verse eid="JDG 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Lekeni iwanu wa Benjamini ng'awawawingile baye Wayebusi iwakalile Yerusalemu, na mbaka leloli aino Wayebusi wokala Yerusalemu hamwe na iwanu wa Benjamini.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamakabila gha Efraimu na Manase ghoisola Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Iwanu wa ghamakabila gha Yosefu nawo, tsawagheluka kughenda kughutowa ghumji ghwa Beteli, naye IMNDEWA tsakawapfila. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Kuya iwanu wa Yusufu watuma wanu waghende kughupelemba ghumji ghwa Beteli. Litaghwa lyake ghumji agho ghumwande tsaghung'ali ghukemighwa Luzu.<verse eid="JDG 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Iwapelembi awo wamwona munu kolawa mna ghumji aghwo, nawo wamlongela, “Tulanguse inzila ya ukwingilila ghumji aghuno, na twetwe ng'atutsokukoma baye.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Na imunu ayo kawalangusa inzila, nawo waghwingila ghumji na kumkoma kwa panga chila munu iyali mumo, lekeni yeye wamleka yoke na iwanu wa ikaye yake yose. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Kuya imunu ayo kahamila isi ya Wahiti, kuko katsenga mji, na kaghukema litaghwa lyake Luzu, na ghumji aghwo ghokemighwa pfipfo mbaka leloli aino.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu ing'awawingighwe na Waisiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Lekeni iwanu wa likabila lya Manase ng'awawawingile baye iwanu iwakalile mna ghumji ghwa Beti Sheani na pfijiji pfake, na ghumji ghwa Taanaki na pfijiji pfake, na ghumji ghwa Dori na pfijiji pfake, na ghumji ghwa Ibileamu na pfijiji pfake, wala awala iwakalile mna ghumji ghwa Megido na pfijiji pfake, kwa apfila Wakanaani tsawananahila ukukala kuko. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Waisiraeli hawapatile keli ngupfu wawananahitsa Wakanaani wawasang'anile ng'onde ng'omu, lekeni ng'awawawingile woke baye.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Pfipfila, iwanu wa kabila lya Efuraimu nawo ng'awawawingile baye Wakanaani iwang'ali wokala Gezeri, apfo Wakanaani waghendelela kukala kuko hamwe na iwanu wa Efuraimu.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Na wanu wa kabila lya Zabuloni ng'awawawingile baye iwanu iwakalile mna ghumji ghwa Kitironi, wala awala iwakalile Nahalali, lekeni Wakanaani waghendelela kukala nawo aku wawananahitsa kusang'ana ng'onde ng'omu.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Wanu wa kabila lya Asheri nawo ng'awawawingile baye iwanu awala iwakalile mna imiji ya Ako, Sidoni, Alabu, Akizibu, Heliba, Afeka, na Rehobu. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Apfo iwanu wa kabila lya Asheri tsawakala hamwe na Wakanaani, iwenyekaye wa isi ayo, kwaapfila ng'awawawingile baye.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Wanu wa kabila lya Nafutali nawo ng'awawawingile baye iwanu iwakalile Beti Shemeshi, au iwanu iwakalile Beti Anati, lekeni tsawakala hamwe nawo. Hata apfo, wawananahitsa iwenyekaye wa imiji ayo mili wawasang'anile ng'onde ng'omu Waisiraeli.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Waamori tsawawawinga iwanu wa likabila lya Dani woke kupfidunda, ng'awawalekile watse wakale mna isi ya ichiwala baye. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Waamori pfipfila tsa wananahila ukukala mna imiji ikalile mna ichidunda cha Heresi, Aiyaloni, na Shaalibimu. Lekeni iwanu wa ghamakabila gha Manase na Efuraimu tsawawatawala Waamori na wawananahitsa wasang'ane ng'onde ng'omu. <verse eid="JDG 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Ghumbaka ghwa Waamori tsaghwandusila kuna ing'alo ya Akirabimu mbaka Sela na kughendelela.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Imalaika wa IMNDEWA ako Bokimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Imalaika wa IMNDEWA tsakoka ako Giligali, kaghenda Bokimu, kawalongela Waisiraeli Imulungu kolonga apfino, “Nene niwalapfa mna isi ya Misiri, na niwaghala mna isi yanilaghane kwa kwilaha na iwabala wenu ka nitsoweng'a. Tsanonga apfino, ‘Nene sitsolileka baye ghendo lilaghano lyangu lyanilaghane na mwemwe, <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />namwe mleke kwika laghano lyolyose na iwanu wa isi aino, na tsimatsabahu tsawo mtsibomole.’ Lekeni mwemwe ng'amnitegheletse baye. Hebali mwemwe mtendile aghano? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Apfo lelo nowalongela, ‘Sitsowawinga keli baye iwanu awano iwokala muisi aino,’ wawo watsowatsupfa, nawo watsakuwa kama mihonga iwahoma mmbapfu mwenu, na imilungu yawo itsakuwa mtegho kuna mwemwe.” <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Aho imalaika wa IMNDEWA hayalongile agho kwa Waisiraeli wose, iwanu watula ndilo. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Na wahakema hanu ahala Bokimu kwa chiebraniya Bokimu mana yake “Iwanu watula ndilo”, na baho wamlapfila IMNDEWA nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Baho Yoshuwa hayawalekile iwanu woke, chila munu kaghenda hanu hake hayagholighwe, kuisola isi iwe yake. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Waisiraeli wamtumikila IMNDEWA matsuwa ghose Yoshuwa hayakalile mghima, na pfipfila mna ghamatsuwa ghose gha ughima wa iwabala tsawo awala iwonile tsisang'ano ng'ulu tsose IMNDEWA tsayawatendele iwanu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="JDG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Yoshuwa imwana wa Nuni, na mtumighwa wa IMNDEWA, kafa aku kana miyaka miya na kumi.<verse eid="JDG 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Nawo wamtsika mna isi iyagholelighwe iwe yake, ako Timunati Heresi, mna isi ya pfidunda pfa Efuraimu, ubali wa Kasikazini wa ichidunda cha Gaashi. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Kuya iwanu wose wa mweleko ghwake nawo wafa, na ghwoneka mweleko ghungi ghwa wanu ing'awammanyile IMNDEWA wala tsisang'ano tsake tsiyawatendele iwanu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli woleka ukumuhulikitsa IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Apfo Waisiraeli wamtendela ghehile IMNDEWA, nawo waitambikila milungu ikemighwa Mabaali. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Wamleka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwabala tsawo, iyawaghalile kulawa isi ya Misiri, wawinza milungu ingi, mna imilungu ya iwanu iwakalile habehi nawo chila ubali, wenama hambele ha imilungu ayo, wamtenda IMNDEWA yaghudubuke.<verse eid="JDG 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Wamleka IMNDEWA, waisang'anila milungu ikemighwe Mabaali na Maashitoreti. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Apfo IMNDEWA kawaghudubukila Waisiraeli, naye kawaleka iwanu wangi wawaboke tsimali tsawo. Kawaleka watowighwe na iwanu iwowehila chila ubali, na ng'awadahile keli baye ukwiyamila na iwehile wawo. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Kwokwose kwawaghendile kwitowa, ghumoko ghwa IMNDEWA ghwinulighwa kuwatendela ighehile, ka pfipfila pfayawakanyile na pfayewalahile. Apfo tsawakala na usungu mkulu.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Kuya IMNDEWA kaweng'a walamtsi, iwawakombole kulawa mna ghamoko gha iwanu iwawabokile tsimali tsawo.<verse eid="JDG 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Hata apfo Waisiraeli ng'awawahulikitse baye walamtsi wawo, mana wawa pfiweghe kwa kuiwinza na kuitambikila milungu ingi. Wasumkila ukughaluka na ukuileka inzila aila yawawinzile iwabala wawo, iwaghakindile ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA, lekeni wawo ng'awaghakindile baye. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Chila IMNDEWA hayaweng'ile mlamtsi, yeye imwenyegho yang'ali yomwapfila imlamtsi ayo na kuwakombola kulawa mna ghamoko gha awala iwawehile, mna ghamatsuwa ghose gha ughima wa imlamtsi ayo, kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakawonela libatsi ahala hayahulike chililo chawo kwa ukughaya na ukughanzika kwawapatile. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Lekeni chila imlamtsi hayafile, iwanu woyila tsinzila tsawo tsihile tsa ghumwande, watenda ghehile kubita iwabala wawo. Waiwinza milungu ingi, waisang'anila na kuitambikila, na walema ghendo ukughaleka ighehile na tsinzila tsawo tsihile.<verse eid="JDG 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Apfo IMNDEWA tsakawaghudubukila ghendo Waisiraeli kalonga, “Kwaapfila iwanu awano ng'awalikindile baye lilaghano lyangu lyanyikile na iwabala tsawo, nawo ng'awanitegheletse baye, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />nene sitsowawinga keli baye iwanu awala iyawalekile Yoshuwa ahala hayafile. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Nitsowatumila iwanu awo kuwaghetsa Waisiraeli, mbone ka watsoiwinza inzila ya IMNDEWA, kubita mna inzila ayo ka pfawatendile iwabala tsawo, au baye.”<verse eid="JDG 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />IMNDEWA kaghaleka makabila agho, wala ng'asumke baye kughawinga kwa kugheka mna ghamoko gha Yoshuwa.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">Iwanu wa isi tsingi iwasighale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Awano wawo iwanu wa tsiisi iwalekighwe na IMNDEWA ili wawaghetse Waisiraeli ing'awana wamanye ukwitowa ng'ondo mna isi ya Kanaani.<verse eid="JDG 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />Tsakatenda apfo ili yawalangulitse ukwitowa ng'ondo iwanu wa ipfeleko apfo, kwaapfila tsang'awana wetowe ng'ondo baye. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Awano wawo iwanu iwasighale, wakulu watano wa Wafilisti, Wakanaani wose, Wasidoni, na Wahivi iwakalile mna ipfidunda pfa Lebanoni, kulawa chidunda cha Baali Herimoni mbaka Hamati.<verse eid="JDG 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Awo tsa kawaleka ili yawaghetse Waisiraeli, yawone ka woghakinda ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA, ghayaweng'ile iwabala tsawo kubitila Musa. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Apfo Waisiraeli tsawakala hamwe na Wakanaani, Wahiti, Waamori, Waperizi, Wahivi na Wayebusi.<verse eid="JDG 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Wawakwela neghe tsawo, na iwana wa iwanu awo wawakwela neghe tsa iwanu wa Isiraeli, na waitambikila imilungu ya iwanu awo.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otinieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Waisiraeli watenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA, wamsemwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wawo, na watumikila milungu ya Mabaali na Maashera. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Apfo IMNDEWA kawaghudubukila Waisiraeli, naye kawatenda watowighwe na Kushani Rishataimu, mfalume wa Mesopotamia, na Waisiraeli wamtumikila ayo Kushani Rishataimu kwa miyaka minane. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Lekeni Wasiraeli Wamlilila IMNDEWA, naye kawaghalila munu wa ukuwakombola iyakemighwe Otinieli, mwana wa Kenazi, mdodo wake Kalebu. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Muhe ghwa IMNDEWA ghumtsila Otinieli, naye kawa mlamtsi wa Isiraeli. Otinieli kaghenda kung'ondo kwitowa, IMNDEWA kamwika Kushani Rishataimu imfalume wa Mesopotamia mmoko mwake, naye kamhuma.<verse eid="JDG 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Apfo isi tsaikala tseghamba kwa miyaka alubaini. Kuya Otinieli imwana wa Kenazi kafa.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Kuya Waisiraeli watenda ighehile hambele ha IMNDEWA Imulungu, naye IMNDEWA kamwing'a ngupfu Egiloni imfalume wa Moabu yawatowe Waisiraeli kwaapfila pfawatendile ighehile hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Ayo Egiloni kakema mtingano ghwa Waamoni na Waamaleki, waghenda naye kwitowa na Waisiraeli, wawatowa na waghusola ghumji ghwa Mitende ighumanyika Yeriko.<verse eid="JDG 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Waisiraeli wamtumikila Egiloni imfalume wa Moabu kwa miyaka kumi na minane.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Lekeni Waisiraeli hawamlilile IMNDEWA, naye kawenulila munu wa kuwakombola, iyakemighwe Ehudi, yeye tsakamamoso, imwana wa Gera wa likabila lya Benjamini. Waisiraeli wamtuma yaghale nzawadi tsawo kwa Egiloni imfalume wa Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Lelo Ehudi tsaketendela maghe ilitema kwosekwose na utali wake ka futi imwe na nusu, kalihomeka mchuno kuna lihatsa lyake lya kujilo, hasi ha tsinguo tsake. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Kuya kamghalila Egiloni tsinzawadi atsila, naye Egiloni tsakakala munu yanenehe ng'ani. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ehudi hayamalitse ukulapfa tsinzawadi, kawalongela iwanu iwadutile tsinzawadi atsila walawe woke. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Lekeni yeye hayapfikile hana ipfinyagho pfa ghamabwe ipfisongolighwe habehi na Giligali, koya kwa Egiloni, kamlongela, “Ghwe mfalume, nina mbuli yako nobama nikulongele chinyele.” Imfalume kalaghitsa watumwa wake kalonga, “Mwinyamale,” nawo walawa kunze wose wamleka.<verse eid="JDG 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Kuya Ehudi kamseghelela imfalume ayula iyakalile hana ichiheleto chake ichiholile, kamlongela, “Nina mbuli yako kulawa kwa Imulungu.” Imfalume kenuka ahala hayakalile hana ichighoda chake kema wima. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Bahala Ehudi kasomola limaghe kwa ghumoko ghwake ghwa kumoso, kulawa hana lihatsa lyake lya kujilo, kamhoma munda mwake. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Limaghe lingila mghati hamwe na muhini ghwake, na lilawilila kumghongo, na ghamapfuta ghaghubika limaghe kwaapfila Ehudi ng'alisomole baye limaghe. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Kuya Ehudi kalawa kunze hachikuta, kahinda imilango ya ichiheleto achila kwa funguwo.<verse eid="JDG 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Ehudi hayokile, iwatumwa wa imfalume woya. Hawonile imilango yose ya ichiheleto ihindighwa kwa ufunguwo, walonga, “Semeghe kaghenda kucholo amwo mchiheleto chake.”<verse eid="JDG 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Wabetetsa mbaka wanza ukwalangula. Hawonile ng'opfughula imilango baye, wasola ifunguwo na waipfughula. Wamwona imfalume wawo kaghwa hasi, naye kafa.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Hawang'ali wobetetsa, Ehudi katsuma koka, kabitila hana ipfinyagho pfa ghamabwe, katsumila Seira. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Hayapfikile ako, katowa malati mna isi ya ipfidunda ya Efuraimu, nawo Waisiraeli wahulumka naye kulawa isi aila ya ipfidunda, aku yeye kawalongolela. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Naye kawalongela, “Mniwinze nene, kwaapfila IMNDEWA kawatenda muwahume wehile wenu Wamoabu.” Baho wahulumka wamuwinza yeye mbaka hana ichiloko cha ghumto ghwa Yoridani, wachiboka ichiloko achila, na ng'awalekile munu wowose yaloke baye.<verse eid="JDG 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Mna litsua alyo, wawakoma Wamoabu kama elufu kumi, asikali awo wose tsawana bapfu na wadaha ukwitowa, na ng'ahonile hata munu yumwe baye. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Mna litsua alyo Waisiraeli wawahuma iwanu wa Moabu. Na isi ikala tseghamba kwa miyaka samanini.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shamgari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Hayamalitse Ehudi, kenuka mlamtsi yungi iyakemighwe Shamgari mwana wa Anati, iyawakomile Wafilisti miya sita kwa biki lya kudimila ng'ombe. Naye pfipfila tsakawakombola Waisiraeli.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">Debora na Baraki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Ehudi hayafile, Waisiraeli watenda keli ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA.<verse eid="JDG 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Apfo IMNDEWA kawaleka watowighwe na mfalume Yabini wa Kanaani, iyatawale ako Hazori, na Sisera tsakakala chilongotsi mkulu wa iwanu wa ing'ondo, naye yang'ali yokala ako Harosheti Hagoimu.<verse eid="JDG 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Kwaapfila Yabini tsakana mituka ya chuma ya ng'ondo miya tisa, naye tsakawadununza ng'ani Waisiraeli kwa miyaka ishirini, nawo wamlilila IMNDEWA yawapfile.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Lelo mna ghamatsuwa agho tsakukala na nabii pinga iyakemighwe Debora, pinga wa Lapidoti, naye tsa mlamtsi wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Debora yang'ali yolamlitsa maghomba hasi ha mbiki ghwa mtende ighukemighwe Mtende ghwa Debora, ighukalile haghati ha imiji ya Rama na Beteli, mna isi ya ipfidunda pfa Efuraimu. Waisiraeli tsawang'ali wogheluka womghendela yakawalamle maghomba ghawo. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Ayo katuma munu yakamkeme Baraki mwana wa Abinoamu iyokala Kadeshi mna isi ya Nafutali. Naye hayatsile kamlongela, “IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli kokulaghitsa apfino, ‘Ghenda usaghule wanu wako elufu kumi kulawa mna ghamakabila gha Nafutali na Zabuloni, na uwatinganitse kuna ichidunda cha Tabori. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Na nene nitsomghala Sisera, ichilongotsi mkulu wa ng'ondo wa Yabini, yatse na wanu wake na mituka yake yetowe naghwe hana ghumto ghwa Kishoni, na nitsomtenda yakutowe.’ ” <verse eid="JDG 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Baraki kamlongela Debora, “Ka kutsoghenda na nene, noghenda. Lekeni ka ng'utsoghenda na nene baye, nani sitsoghenda baye.” <verse eid="JDG 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Debora kamwidika kalonga, “Pfinogha, nitsoghenda naghwe, lekeni ako kwaughenda ng'utsotunyighwa baye kwa ukuhuma ing'ondo, kwaapfila IMNDEWA katsomleka Sisera yatowighwe na ipinga.” Apfo Debora kenuka, kelongotsa na Baraki waghenda Kedeshi. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Ako Kadeshi Baraki kawakema na kawatinganitsa Wazabuloni na Wanafutali, na wanu elfu kumi wagheluka wamghendela. Naye Debora kaghenda hamwe naye.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Matsuwa agho Heberi, iyakalile Mkeni, tsakebaghula na Wakeni wayaghe iwakalile watsukulu wa Hobabu, mlamu wake Musa, naye tsakatsenga hema lyake kutali kuna ghumbiki mkulu ighukemighwe mwaloni ako Zaananimu, habehi na Kedeshi.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Wanu wamlongela Sisera ka Baraki mwana wa Abinoamu kagheluka kuchidunda Tabori. <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />Sisera kakunga mituka yake yose, mituka miya tisa ya chuma, na kawakema iwanu wake wose wa ing'ondo, kaghenda nawo kulawa Harosheti Hagoimu, mbaka kuna ghumto ghwa Kishoni. <verse eid="JDG 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Debora kamlongela Baraki, “Winuke ughende! Kwaapfila leloli lilyo litsuwa IMNDEWA liyamlekile Sisera yatowighwe na ghweghwe. Angu IMNDEWA ng'akulongolele hambele hako?” Apfo Baraki kahulumka kulawa kuchidunda Tabori na wanu elufu kumi wamuwinza. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />IMNDEWA kamuweghetsa Sisera na iwanu wake wose, na iwakulu wake wa ing'ondo wose kwa mimaghe itema hambele ha Baraki na wanu wake, kahulumka mna ghumtuka ghwake ghwa chuma, katsuma kwa mighulu. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Lekeni Baraki kawawinza iwanu wa ing'ondo na imituka yawo ya chuma mbaka Harosheti Hagoimu, kawakoma iwanu wose wa Sisera kwa limaghe, ng'alekile munu mghima hata yumwe.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Sisera tsakatsumila kuna lihema lya Yaeli, mwehe wa Heberi, Mkeni, kwaapfila Yabini mfalume wa Hazori tsakakala tseghamba na iwanu wa ikaye ya Heberi, Mkeni. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Yaeli kalawa kunze yakambokele Sisera, naye kamlongela, “Ghwe mfalume wangu, wingile mng'anda, uleke kupfuka.” Apfo kengila mna lihema lyake, naye kamghubika na mgholole. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Sisera kalonga, “Nina ng'ilu, nokulomba ungaye matsi chidogho nuwe.” Yeye kasola matsiwa kamwing'a kanwa, kuya kamghubika keli. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Sisera kamlongela Yaeli, “Wime hana ghumlango ghwa lihema, na munu wowose yang'atsa kukughutsa kulonga, ‘Pfihi ahano hana munu?’ Ubele, ulonge, ‘Mbe! Haduhu munu.’” <verse eid="JDG 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Lekeni Yaeli, mwehe wa Heberi, kasola chighingi cha lihema na nyundo, kamghendela kwa kumnyatila, aku imwenyegho kamnongo, kwaapfila tsakepfa na ghumwanza, kachikomelela ichighingi achila mchihanga mwake, nacho chingila mbaka chilawilila mlidongo. Baho Sisera kafa. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Naye Baraki hayang'ali yomuwinza Sisera, Yaeli kalawa kunze yambokele, kamlongela, “Utse, na nene nitsokulangusa imunu yumbama.” Baraki kengila mng'anda mwa lihema lya Yaeli, na kampfika Sisera kahasi, kafa, na ichighingi cha lihema cha mchihanga mwake.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Apfo mna litsuwa alyo IMNDEWA kamtowa Yabini, mfalume wa Kanaani, hambele ha iwana wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Waisiraeli waghendelela kuwa na ngupfu na kumtowa Yabini, mfalume wa Kanaani, mbaka hawamkomile ghendo ayo Yabini, imfalume wa Kanaani.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa Debora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Mna litsuwa alyo, Debora na Baraki mwana wa Abinoamu wemba wila auno:<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />Pfilongotsi tsawalawila kuilongotsa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">na iwanu tsawelapfa kwa kubama wenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">mtunyeni IMNDEWA!<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Hulikeni mwemwe muwafalume!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Muwambe ghamaghutwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">mwemwe muwakulu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Nene nitsomwimbila IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">nitsomtowela chilimba IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Imulungu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, haulawile ako Seiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">hauhulumke mna ichidunda cha Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">isi tsaidedema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">kulanga kulaghatsa matsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">nagho ghamabingu ghalaghatsa mvula.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Ipfidunda pfihighisika hambele ha IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:5">Ona, hata ichidunda cha Sinai chihighisika hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Mna ghamatsuwa gha Shamgari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">mwana wa Anati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">mna ghamatsuwa gha Yaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">nzila ng'ulu tsikala tsahela wanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">iwali mna ghumwanza wang'ali wakwang'a nzila tsili mmbalimbali.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Iwanu iwolima tsawahaduhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">tsawahupa mna isi ya Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">mbaka nene Debora haninuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">haninuke kama mamo mna isi ya Isiraeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Wesaghulila milungu ingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">baho kulawila ng'ondo muisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">Kuduhu hata yumwe yakindile mgoha au ngawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">mna iwanu elufu alubaini wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghowadeng'elela iwakulu wa ing'ondo wa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">hamwe na awala iwelapfile wenyegho mna iwanu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">Mtunyeni IMNDEWA!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Mwemwe yamdina wapfihongwe watselu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">na yamkalila matandiko gha bei ng'ulu ighakwikighwa mchanya mwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">na mwemwe yamkwanga mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">walongeleni iwanu imbuli aino.<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Wategheletseni iwanu iwakwimba iwali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">hana ipfisima pfa ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">aho wakwimba ukuhuma kwa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">ukuhuma kwa iwanu wake mna isi ya Isiraeli.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:11" />
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Baho iwanu wa IMNDEWA wahulumka kuna ghamalango gha ghumji.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />Lamka, lamka, Debora!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Lamka, lamka, wimbe wila!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Winuke, Baraki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">usole iwanu wako wauwaghoghile kung'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">ghweghwe mwana wa Abinoamu.<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Baho iwanu iwasighale wahulumka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">iwanu wa IMNDEWA waghenda kwitowa na awala wane tsingupfu.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Watsa wanu kulawa Efuraimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">iwang'ali wokala kwa Waamaleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">kuya iwanu wa Benjamini nawo tsawahulumka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">kulawa Makiri tsawahulumka pfilongotsi wa ing'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">na kulawa Zabuloni watsa pfilongotsi wakulu.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Iwakulu wa Isakari watsa hamwe na Debora,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">nawo iwanu wa Isakari tsawamtoghola ng'ani Baraka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">nawo wasumkila ukughenda hamwe naye mbaka mchiwala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Lekeni tsikolo tsa Rubeni tsatsighola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">imimoyo yawo ing'ali ikwalangula waghende au waleke kughenda.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Hebali mkalile kuchughu hamwe na wang'olo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Pfihi mng'ali mhulikitsa tsifilimbi tsa iwadimi pfawokema wang'olo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Lekeni tsikolo tsa Rubeni tsatsighola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">imimoyo yawo ing'ali ikwalangula waghende au waleke kughenda.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Wagileadi tsawakala kumwambu mwa Yoridani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Na hebali Wadani tsawakala mna tsimeli matsuwa mengi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Waasheri wawo tsawasindamala kumwani mwa ibahari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">wakala mna tsibandali tsawo.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Wazabuloni wawo iwanu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">iwakalile tiyali kulapfa ughima wawo mna lifwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">na Wanafutali nawo watenda pfipfo mna ichibwalu cha ing'ondo.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Iwafalume watsa, wetowa ng'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">iwafalume wa Kanaani wetowa ako Taanaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">habehi na tsimbwibwi tsa Megido,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">lekeni ng'awabokile fetsa wala chinu chochose baye.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Nako kulanga tsinondo natso tsatsitowa ng'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">tsatsiwinza tsinzila tsake, tsatsitowa na Sisera.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Ghamatsi gha mto Kishoni ghamema ghawakululusa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">ghumto aghula ghwa ghumwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">ghumto ghwa Kishoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">Ghwe muhe ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">ughendelele hambele kwa ngupfu!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Baho tsing'wato tsa wafalasi tsibita kwa chisindo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:22">walapfa chisindo hawang'ali wotsuma kwa ngupfu.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Imalaika wa IMNDEWA kolonga apfino:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">“Ghulighiteni ghumji ghwa Merozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">walighiteni kwa usungu iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">kwaapfila ng'awatsile kune ing'ondo ya IMNDEWA baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">kumwapfila IMNDEWA ukwitowa na iwehile wake wane ingupfu.”<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Yabarikighwe Yaeli, mwehe wa Heberi, Mkeni, kubita wapinga wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">Pfipfo, yabarikighwe kubita wapinga wose iwokala mna ghamahema.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Sisera kalomba matsi, naye kamwing'a matsiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:25">kamghalila matsiwa gha mtindi mna libakuli lya ukunwela iwakulu.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Kwa moko ghumwe kakinda chighingi cha hema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">na kwa ghumoko ghwa kujilo kakinda inyundo ya fundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">kamhonda litwi Sisera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">kamtula na kambang'anyula ichihanga chake.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Sisera kenama, kaghwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">kawasa tulu ghendo hamaghulu ghake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">Bahala hayenamile baho kaghwa, kuya kafa.<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />Mai wake Sisera kasungulila hana lidilisha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">na baho hana lidilisha kanza ukulila, kalonga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">“Hebali ghumtuka ghwake ghwa chuma ighukweghighwa na falasi ghukawa ukupfika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">Mbona ichisindo cha tsing'wato tsa wafalasi wa imituka yake chokawa ukuhulikika?”<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Wapinga iwakengele iwang'ali womtumikila wamwidika, wamhotsa ghumoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:29">naye kaghendelela kwilongela:<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />“songaha wegholela ipfinu pfawabokile kung'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">mwali yumwe au weli kwa chila mmale yumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">bwende lya mighala ya ng'olo lya langi kwa ajili ya Sisera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">bwende lya mighala ya ng'olo lighelighwe unzolingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">na mitandilo mili ya unzolingo mwingi kwa ajili ya isingo yangu!”<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />Ghwe IMNDEWA! Awala iwokuhila wose wafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">Lekeni awala iwokukunda wawe ka tsuwa pfalilangatsa ahala halilawa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">Nayo isi ikala tseghamba ghendo kwa miyaka alubaini.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Gidioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Waisiraeli watenda keli ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA, naye IMNDEWA kawaleka watowighwe na Wamidiani kwa miyaka saba. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Wamidiani tsawawatendela pfihile ng'ani Waisiraeli, mbaka Waisiraeli wehimbila mapondo na tsimango kupfidunda pfiwe hanu ha ukwipfisa. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Chila Waisiraeli hawang'ali wohanda tsimbeghu mmighunda, Wamidiani na Waamaleki na iwanu wa ako mashariki wang'ali wakutsa kuwatowa. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Iwanu awo weka ndalo muisi, wahinya ipfijo pfawo pfose pfili muisi mbaka haughenda Gaza, wawaboka wang'olo, wang'ombe na wapfihongwe, wala ng'awawalekele chinu chochose Waisiraeli.<verse eid="JDG 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Wang'ali wakutsa wengi kulonga nzighe, wawo na ng'ombe tsawo, na mahema ghawo, tsang'aidahika baye ukuwapeta pfawakalile wengi iwanu awo hamwe na ngamiya wawo, nawo tsawengila muisi amwo ili kuihinya isi ayo. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Wamidiani wawatenda Waisiraeli wawe nyondenyonde, apfo Waisiraeli wamlilila IMNDEWA yawapfile.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Waisiraeli hawamlilile IMNDEWA yawalapfile ghamaghayo ghawapatile kulawa kwa Wamidiani, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />IMNDEWA kawaghalila nabii, naye kawalongela apfino: Achino chicho IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, chayolonga, “Tsaniwalongotsa mgheluke kulawa isi ya Misiri, kulawa isi yamkalile mwa watumwa. <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />Niwakombola mna ghamoko gha Wamisiri, na mna ghamoko gha awala wose iwawadununze, niwawinga hambele henu hamng'ali mkutsa, na kuweng'a mwemwe isi yawo. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Kuya niwalongela apfino, nene na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, mleke kuitamanila imilungu ya Waamori, wane isi yamuisolile, lekeni mwemwe ng'amnitegheletse baye.”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Malaika wa IMNDEWA kaghenda, kakala hasi ha ghumbiki ghwa mwaloni ako Ofura, ghwa Yoashi, wa lukolo lwa Abiezeri. Na Gidioni imwanaghe ayo Yoashi yang'ali yobeta ngano mghati mwa lipondo lya ukukamila tsinzabibu, yaifise ili Wamidiani waleke kuyona.<verse eid="JDG 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Imalaika wa IMNDEWA hayamlawile Gidioni, kamlongela: “IMNDEWA kahamwe naghwe, ghweghwe yauli mtowa ng'ondo yaulihela wogha.”<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Gidioni kamwidika kalonga, “Ghwe mfalume wangu, ka IMNDEWA Imulungu ka hamwe na twetwe, heule ghatupatile aghano ghose? Na tsili kwani tsisang'ano tsake itsikangawatsa, tsawatupetele iwabala wetu, ahala hawalongile, ‘Pfihi si IMNDEWA baye yatughalile akuno kulawa Misiri?’ Lekeni lelo IMNDEWA katwasa na katutenda tutowighwe na Wamidiani!”<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />IMNDEWA kamuhundukila kamlongela, “Ghenda kwa tsingufu tsako tsitsino tsauli natso, ukawakombole Waisiraeli kulawa mna ghamoko gha Wamidiani. Pfihi si nene baye yanikutuma?”<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Gidioni kamwidika, “Leka ghwe IMNDEWA! Nitsodahatse nene kuikombola Isiraeli? Ulole, ilukolo lwangu nene lwa nyondenyonde kubita kolo tsose mna likabila lya Manase, na nene nimwenyegho sili chinu baye kubita wose mna ikaye ya aba wangu.”<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Naye IMNDEWA kamlongela, “Nene nitsakuwa hamwe na ghweghwe, na nitsokutenda uwakome ghendo Wamidiani ka apfila kokoma munu yumwe.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gidioni kamwidika, kalonga, “Ka ghweghwe kunitoghola, ungaye chitango nene nimanye ka ghweghwe yuyo yaulonga na nene. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Nokulomba uleke kuka ahano mbaka nene mbuye na kukughalila nzawadi yangu na kuyika hambele hako.” Na IMNDEWA kalonga, “Ghoya, nitsobeta ahano mbaka haukuya.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Gidioni kaghenda mng'anda mwake, kambika nyama ya mene mdoghodogho, na kwa usaghe wa makimbo kumi koka pfighate ipfilihela hamila kaghuma inyama mna ichiseghe, na ghumtsuho kaghuma mchiha, kuya kamghalila ahala hasi ha ghumbiki ghwa mwaloni, na kayika hambele hake. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Na imalaika wa Imulungu kamlongela, “Usole inyama na ipfighate apfo upfike mchanya mwa libambalawe alino, kuya umwaghile ghumtsuho mchanya mwake.” Naye Gidioni katenda pfipfo. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Imalaika wa IMNDEWA kagholosa ing'weku ikalile mmoko mwake, na kusa kwa ing'weku aila kadonza inyama aila na ipfighate apfila. Baho moto ghulawa mbambalawe, ghulambita ghendo inyama na ipfighate apfo. Na baho imalaika wa IMNDEWA kagha.<verse eid="JDG 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Gidioni hayatangile kama ayula tsakakala malaika wa IMNDEWA, kadalamka kalonga, “Nyifa nene! Ghwe MNDEWA Imulungu! Kwaapfila nimwona imalaika wako kwa tsinenge tsangu.”<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kamlongela, “Ukale tseghamba, uleke kupfuka, ng'utsakufa baye.” <verse eid="JDG 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Kuko Gidioni kamtsengela IMNDEWA matsabahu, na kaikema, “IMNDEWA katindiwalo.” Imatsabahu ayo mbaka leloli aino ing'ali kuko Ofura, ghumji ghwa Waabiezeri.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Ichilo chicho IMNDEWA kamlongela, “Msole ing'ombe mmale wa keli wa aba wako, iyana miyaka saba, uibomole imatsabahu ya Baali iyali nayo aba wako na uchighane ichinyagho cha Ashera ichili habehi nayo. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Kuya umtsengele matsabahu IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, mna iludando aluno kwa mabwe ighapangighwe ghoya, kuya umsole ing'ombe ayula wakeli undapfile nambiko ya kulakatsighwa kwa kutumila tsing'odi atsila tsa ichinyago achila cha Ashera chautsochighana.” <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Apfo Gidioni kasola watumwa wake kumi, na katenda ka pfayamlaghitse. Lekeni kwaapfila tsakawapfuka iwanu wa ikaye ya aba wake na iwanu wa ghumji, ng'adahile kughatenda agho nemisi baye, ila kaghatenda nechilo.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Nemitondo iwanu wa ghumji hawalamke wona imatsabahu ya Baali ibomolighwa, na ichinyagho cha Ashera ichikalile habehi nayo chighanighwa na matsabahu ingi itsengighwa na mchanya mwake ing'ombe mmale wa keli kalakatsighwa nambiko.<verse eid="JDG 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Nawo weghutsa, “Nani iyatendile ichinu achino?” Hawaghutsile ghutsile na kupelemba walongelighwa, “Gidioni, imwana wa Yoashi, yeye iyatendile ichinu achino.” <verse eid="JDG 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Apfo iwanu wa ghumji wamlongela Yoashi, “Mlete imwanagho ahano yakomighwe, kwaapfila kaibomola imatsabahu ya Baali na kachighana ichinyagho cha Ashera ichikalile habehi nayo.”<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Lekeni Yoashi kawalongela iwanu awala iwaghendile kwisonga naye, “Pfihi mwemwe mwodaha kumwamila Baali? Mwoghetsa ukumkombola? Munu wowose iyomwalamila na yakomighwe pfipfino ng'ana kuche. Ka Baali Imulungu ghendo mlekeni yeyamile imwenyegho kwa apfila kuna munu kaibomola imatsabahu yake.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Apfo kulawa litsuwa alyo wamkema Gidioni “Yeru Baali,” mana yake, “Baali yeyamile mwenyegho.” Kwaapfila kaibomola imatsabahu yake.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Kuya Wamidiani, Waamaleki na wanu wose iwokala ubali wa mashariki wetingana hamwe, waloka ghumto ghwa Yoridani na weka tsindalo tsawo mna ilwanda lwa Yezireeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Pfipfila Ghumuhe ghwa IMNDEWA ghumtsila na kumlongotsa Gidioni, naye katowa malati kawakema Waabiezeri watse wamuwinze. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Kuya katuma wasenga waghende mna isi yose ya Manase wawakeme iwanu wamuwinze, na wasenga wangi kawatuma waghenda kuwakema iwanu wa makabila gha Asheri na Zabuloni na Nafutali, nawo waghenda kwitingana naye.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Pfipfila Gidioni kamlongela Imulungu, “Ka kutsowakombola Waisiraeli kubitila nene ka pfaulongile, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />ulole nakwika chigotsi cha ng'olo mna ichibwalu cha ukubetela ingano, ka ichigotsi acho chitsakuwa na tungwe chiliyeka, na isi yose ing'akala yahela ghendo litungwe, aho nitsomanya ghendo ka kutsowakombola Waisiraeli kwa ghumoko ghwangu ka pfulongile.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Na ilawila pfipfo, kwaapfila nemitondo hayalamke kona litungwe mchanya mwa ichigotsi, kachikama ichigotsi acho, litungwe limema bakuli ngima. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Kuya Gidioni kamlongela Imulungu, “Uleke kungudubukila, leka nikulombe chinu chingi keli. Nokulomba unileke nighetse keli kwa ichigotsi chichino. Lelo nobama ichigotsi achino chiliyeka chisakale, lekeni isi yose iwe na litungwe.” <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Ichilo acho Imulungu katenda pfipfo. Ichigotsi chiliyeka chisakala, na isi yose iwa na litungwe.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Gidioni kawahuma Wamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Nemitondotondo, Yeru Baali, pfipfila iyakemighwe Gidioni na iwanu wake iwakalile hamwe naye walamka, weka indalo yawo mlwanda habehi na imbwibwi ya Harodi. Nawo Wamidiani tsaweka indalo yawo ubali wa kasikazini habehi na ichidunda More, mlwanda.<verse eid="JDG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Gidioni, “Iwanu wauli nawo wengi ng'ani kwa nene ukuwatenda Wamidiani watowighwe na mwemwe, Waisiraeli tsawaleke kwitunya hambele hangu walonge ka wekombola wenyegho. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Lelo walongele apfino iwanu, ‘Imunu wowose iyodedema na iyopfuka yahunduke yoye ukaye yake.’” Apfo iwanu elufu ishilini na weli woka ukaye naye kakala na wanu elufu kumi iwasighale.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Lekeni IMNDEWA Imulungu kamlongela Gidioni, “Iwanu wauli nawo wang'ali wengi sideke, wahulumse kuna imbwibwi, nani nitsowaghetsa ako, imunu wowose yanitsokulongela, ‘Ayuno katsoghenda naghwe,’ ayo yaghende naghwe. Lekeni yanitsokulongela ‘ng'atsoghenda naghwe baye,’ imunu ayo yaleke kughenda naghwe.” <verse eid="JDG 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Apfo Gidioni kawasola iwanu awala kahulumka nawo kuna imbwibwi, na IMNDEWA kamlongela, “Kutsowabaghula iwanu awala iwolambita ghamatsi kwa milimi yawo ka yumbwa na awala iwakunwa ghamatsi kwa kutowa mapfindi.” <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Iwanu iwanwele ghamatsi kwa kudegha kwa ghamoko ghawo tswapetighwa wapfika wanu miya ndatu, lekeni wamwenga tsawanwa ghamatsi kwa kutowa mapfindi. <verse eid="JDG 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Gidioni, “Nitsowakombola kubitila iwanu miya ndatu iwanwele ghamatsi kwa kulambita ka yumbwa, na nitsowatenda Wamidiani watowighwe na ghweghwe. Lekeni awano wamwenga muwaleke woke, chila munu ukaye yake.” <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Baho iwanu awala wasola ipfijo pfawo na tsimalati tsawo kuya Gidioni kawaleka woke chila munu kuna indalo yake, lekeni awala miya ndatu tsakawaleka. Na indalo ya Wamidiani tsaikala kuhisi kunyika.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Chilo chicho IMNDEWA kamlongela Gidioni, “Ulamke uhulumke kuhisi ukawatowele mna tsindalo tsawo kwaapfila nitsokutenda uwahume. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Lekeni ka kopfuka kuhulumka, uhulumke na mtumwa wako Pura. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Ako kutsohulika ghose ghawolonga, naghwe kutsopata ngupfu ya kuwatowa.” Apfo Gidioni kahulumka na mtumwa wake Pura mbaka hanu hawakalile wabetetsi wa indalo ya Wamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Wamidiani na Waamaleki na iwanu wose iwolawila ubali wa mashariki tsawakala mlwanda, tsawawengi ka nzighe, na wangamia wawo ng'awodaha ukupetighwa baye, tsawawengi ka msanga.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Gidioni hayapfikile, kahulika munu yumwe komsimulila miyaghe pfayalotile, kalonga, “Miyagho tsandota apfino, mbona chighate cha shayili chilaghala mbaka mna indalo ya Wamidiani, chihonda hema, na kulibidula lihema alyo mbaka hasi.”<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Miyaghe kamwidika, “Indoto ayo yomlonga Gidioni munu wa Isiraeli, mwana wa Yoashi, na si chinu chingi baye. IMNDEWA kamtenda yawahume Wamidiani na lijeshi lyetu lyose.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Gidioni hayahulike imunu ayo pfayalotile na chayalotile chilonga choni, kamfughamila IMNDEWA. Kuya koya kuna indalo ya Waisiraeli, kawalongela, “Mwinuke tuke, kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu katutenda tuwahume Wamidiani.” <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Apfo kawaghola makingili madatu iwanu awala miya ndatu, na kaweng'a malati na pfiya pfina imiwenge ya ghumoto. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Kawalongela, “Mndole na mtende chanitsotenda ahala hanitsopfika habehi na indalo. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Nene na wayangu iwali na nene hatutsotowa tsimalati tsetu, namwe mtowe tsimalati tsenu chila hanu hamli na kukemelela, mlonge, ‘Kwa IMNDEWA na kwa Gidioni.’” <verse eid="JDG 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Ng'ana chilo ghati chingile ghendo baye, Gidioni na iwanu awala miya imwe iwakalile hamwe naye wapfika kwaitsighile indalo, ahala wabetetsi Wamidiani hawang'ali webokela. Watowa tsimalati tsawo na kutula ipfiya ipfili mmwoko mwawo. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Makingili ghose madatu gha iwanu ghatowa tsimalati tsawo, na watula ipfiya pfawo. Na mna ghamoko ghawo gha kumoso wakinda imiwenge ya ghumoto na mna ghamoko ghawo gha kujilo wakinda tsimalati tsawo na kutsitowa na walonga, “Limaghe lya Gidioni na lya IMNDEWA!” <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Chila munu kema hanu hake kutsunguluka indalo. Wamidiani wose watsuma aku wokemelela. <verse eid="JDG 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Iwanu wa Gidioni hawatowile tsimalati tsawo miya ndatu, IMNDEWA kawatenda Wamidiani wekome iwenyegho kwa wenyegho kwa limaghe. Awala iwakalile waghima watsumila Beti Shita, waghendelela mbaka Serera mbaka kuna ghumbaka ghwa Abeli Mehola habehi na Tabati.<verse eid="JDG 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Waisiraeli wa likabila lya Nafutali, Asheri na Manase, wose tsawetingana hamwe wawawinza Wamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Kuya Gidioni katuma wanu mna isi yose ya pfidunda ya Efuraimu kalonga, “Muhulumke muwatowe Wamidiani na muwaghome kwa kuboka pfikolongo na ghumto Yoridani mbaka Beti Bara.” Apfo wamale wose wa Efuraimu watsa waghuboka ghumto Yoridani mbaka Beti Bara. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Pfipfila wawaghogha pfilongotsi weli wa Wamidiani, Orebu na Zeebu. Wamkoma Orebu mna libambalawe lya Orebu, naye Zeebu wamkomela hanu ha ukukamila tsinzabibu ha Zeebu. Kuya waghendelela kuwawinza Wamidiani na wamghalila Gidioni ghamatwi gha Orebu na Zeebu kumwambu kwa ghumto Yoridani.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s">Wamidiani wotowighwa ghendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Wanu wa kabila lya Efuraimu wamghutsa Gidioni, “Ule ututendele apfino? Ule ng'utukemile baye haughendile kwitowa na Wamidiani?” Apfo wamkembela ng'ani.<verse eid="JDG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Lekeni yeye kawedika, “Aghala ghanendile nene si chinu baye kubita aghala ghamtendile mwemwe. Achila chidodo chamtendile mwemwe wanu wa Efuraimu chikulu kubita ghawatendile iwanu wangu wa lukolo lwa Abiazeri. <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Imulungu kawatenda Orebu na Zeebu ipfilongotsi weli wa Wamidiani watowighwe na mwemwe. Angu lelo nitendile choni kubita mwemwe?” Gidioni hayalongile apfo, baho waleka kumghudubukila.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Gidioni na iwanu wake mia ndatu wapfika kuna ghumto Yoridani, na waloka. Hata ka tsawepfa sideke waghendelelela kuwawinza Wamidiani.<verse eid="JDG 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Naye kawalongela iwanu wa Sukoti, “Weng'eni ichijo wanu wangu iwoniwinza waje kwaapfila wepfa sideke, twetwe tung'ali twowakoleletsa Zeba na Salimuna, wafalume wa Midiani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Lekeni iwakulu wa Sukoti wamghutsa Gidioni, “Mwemwe ng'ana muwaghoghe Zeba na Salimuna, heule kobama tuweng'e ichijo wanu wako?”<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Gidioni kawalongela, “Pfinogha, lekeni IMNDEWA hayatsonyapfila niwaghoghe Zeba na Salimuna, nitsotsihoma ng'uli tsenu kwa mihonga na tsimiwa tsa kunyika.”<verse eid="JDG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Kulawa aho Gidioni kawaghendela iwanu wa Penueli, kawalomba pfipfila, lekeni wamwidika ka pfawamwidike iwanu wa Sukoti.<verse eid="JDG 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Apfo kawalongela iwanu wa Penueli, “Hanitsakuya aku niwahuma iwafalume awo, nitsoghuhinya ghumnala ghwenu.”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Zeba na Salimuna tsawakala ako Karikori, hamwe na lijeshi lyawo lya wanu elufu kumi na tano iwasighale kulawa kwa iwanu wake wa mashariki, kwaapfila wayawo laki imwe na ishirini tsawakomighwa. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Apfo Gidioni na iwanu wake waghenda kuna inzila ya wachuutsi ili ubali wa mashaliki ya pfijiji pfa Noba na Yogibeha, wawatowa kwaapfila tsang'awakalile ghoya kwa ukwitowa baye. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Wafalume wa Midiani, Zeba na Salimuna, watsuma, lekeni Gidioni kawawinza na kawaghogha na iwanu wose wa ing'ondo wa iwafalume awo, nawo wengilighwa na wogha.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Kuya Gidioni mwana wa Yoashi, tsakoya kulawa kung'ondo kwa kubitila ing'alo ya Heresi. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Kamghogha msongolo yumwe wa Sukoti na kumghutsa. Na imsongolo ayo kamwandikila mataghwa gha iwakulu na iwabala iwomanyika wa Sukoti. Awo wose tsawapfika sabini na saba.<verse eid="JDG 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Kuya Gidioni kawoyila iwanu wa Sukoti, kawalongela, “Ambe mwokumbuka pfamndighile ahala hamlongile, ‘Mwemwe mng'ali kuwaghogha Zeba na Salimuna? Ule kobama tuweng'e ichijo wanu wako iwepfile?’ ” Haya lelo, Zeba na Salimuna awano ahano.<verse eid="JDG 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Kasola mihonga ya kunyika na tsimiwa kawakanya kwa kuwatowela iwanu na iwakulu wa Sukoti.<verse eid="JDG 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Kuya kaghubomola ghumnala ghwa Penueli na kuwakoma iwanu wa ghumji aghwo.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Pfipfila kawaghutsa Zeba na Salimuna, “Iwanu awala wamuwakomile akula Taboli wali pfii?” Wamwidika, “Weghala na ghweghwe, kwaapfila chila yumwe tsakoneka ka mwana wa mfalume.”<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Gidioni kawedika, “Iwanu awo ndughu tsangu, twong'a tombo limwe. Nelaha ka IMNDEWA pfayali mghima, ka mng'awalekile waghima, na nene ning'alekile kuwakoma mwemwe.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Kuya kamlongela Yeteli, imwanaghe chaudele, “Wakome!” Lekeni Yeteli ng'asomole baye limaghe lyake, kwaapfila yang'ali yopfuka, na yang'ali msongolo. <verse eid="JDG 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Bahala Zeba na Salimuna walonga, “Tukome mwenyegho, kwaapfila aino ng'onde ya munu mkulu.” Apfo Gidioni kenuka kawakoma Zeba na Salimuna na kasola unzolingo ukalile msingo mwa wangamia wawo.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Kuya Waisiraeli wamlongela Gidioni, “Uwe chilongotsi wetu ghweghwe na wanagho na watsukulu wako, kwaapfila kutukombola kulawa mna ghamoko gha Wamidiani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Gidioni kawalongela, “Nene sitsowalongotsa baye wala watsukulu wangu, IMNDEWA yuyo iyatsowalongotsa.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Kuya kawalongela apfino, “Nowalomba chinu chimwe, chila munu yangolele tsiheleni tsa mmaghutwi tsayabokile kung'ondo.” Kwaapfila Wamidiani awala tsa Waishimaeli, wang'ali wopfalagha heleni tsa nzahabu mna ghamaghutwi ghawo.<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Wamwidika, “Twetwe tokwing'a kwa ghumoyo ghwose.” Apfo watandatsa gholole na chila munu keka tsiheleni tsayabokile kung'ondo. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Tsiheleni tsose tsayabamile wamwing'e tsipimighwa tsipfika ka kilo ishilini. Pfipfila tsakeng'ighwa maghwanda ghanoghile gha nzambalao ighapfalighwe na wafalume wa Midiani, na mikufu ikalile msingo mwa wangamia wawo. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Ipfinu apfo pfose Gidioni kapfitengenetsela chinyagho, kuya kaghenda kuchika kuna ghumji ghwake ghwa Ofira. Waisiraeli wose waghendagha ako kuchitambikila. Ichinyagho acho chiwa nyonzo kwa Gidioni na iwanu wa ikaye yake. <verse eid="JDG 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Apfo Wamidiani tsawatowighwa ghendo na Waisiraeli, wawa si wanu wa kupfukighwa keli baye. Na isi ya Isiraeli ikala tseghamba kwa miyaka alubaini, matsuwa ghose Gidioni hayakalile mghima.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Gidioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Kuya ayo Yeru Baali, mwana wa Yoashi, koya ukaye yake kukala. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Gidioni tsakana wana wamale sabini, kwaapfila tsakakwela wapinga wengi.<verse eid="JDG 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Tsakana pinga wa kunze iyakalile Shekemu, iyamwelekele mwana mmale, iyamkemile Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Gidioni mwana wa Yoashi tsakafa na miyaka mingi, wamtsika hana ichibaka cha Yoashi aba wake, kuna ghumji ghwa Ofira wa Wabiezeri.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Gidioni hayafile, Waisiraeli wayuyila keli milungu ya Baali na kuitambikila. Wamtenda Baali Beriti yawe mulungu wawo. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Ng'awamkumbuke baye IMNDEWA wawo iyawakombole kulawa kwa iwanu iwawehile iwawatsunguluke.<verse eid="JDG 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Pfipfila ng'awawatendele ghanoghile baye iwanu wa ikaye ya Yeru Baali, ayo Gidioni, kwa aghala ghose ighanoghile ghayawatendele.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Abimeleki, imwana wa Gidioni kawaghendela ndughu wose wa mai wake iwokala Shekemu, kawalongela, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Waghutseni iwanu wose wa Shekemu, ‘Chinu chachi chamkona chinogha, iwana wose sabini wa Yeru Baali wawalongotse mwemwe au mwana yumwe yawalongotse?’ Mkumbuke ka nene na damu yenu.” <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Wandughu wa mai wake wawalongela iwanu wa Shekemu aghala ghayawalongele Abimeleki, na iwanu wose wa Shekemu walamla kumuwinza Abimeleki kwaapfila tsa ndughu yawo. <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Wamwing'a pfihande sabini pfa fetsa ipfilawile mna ing'anda ya Baali Beriti, naye Abimeleki kawaliha iwanu waghobo ili wamuwinze.<verse eid="JDG 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Kaghenda nawo ukaye kwa aba wake ako Ofira, naye kawakoma ndughu tsake sabini iwanaghe Yeru Baali kwa kuwakoma mchanya mwa bambalawe. Lekeni Yotamu, imwana mdodo wa Yeru Baali, ng'akomighwe baye kwaapfila tsakepfisa.<verse eid="JDG 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Iwanu wose wa Shekemu na Beti Milo wetingana hamwe hana ghumbiki ighuli habehi na ghumnala ako Shekemu, kuko wamtenda Abimaleki yawe mfalume wawo.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Yotamu hayahulike apfo, kaghenda kwima kuna ichidanando cha chidunda cha Gerizimu, naye kakemelela kalonga, “Mwemwe iwanu wa Shekemu ka mwobama Imulungu yawategheletse mwemwe tanu mnitegheletse nene. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Tsuwa limwe, imibiki ighenda kwisaghulila mfalume wawo, ighulongela mzeituni, ‘Uwe mfalume wetu!’ <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Lekeni mzeituni ghwidika, ‘Pfihi ndeke isang'ano yangu ya ukulapfa ghamapfuta, ighowanoghela imilungu na iwanu, ng'ende nikawe mfalume wa mibiki?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Kuya imibiki ighulongela ghumtini, ‘Utse uwe mfalume wetu!’ <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Lekeni ghumtini ghwidika, ‘Angu ndeke isang'ano yangu ya ukweleka ghamatunda ighanoghile na ighali mta, na nitse nikawe mfalume wa mibiki?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Kuya imibiki ighulongela mnzabibu, ‘Utse uwe mfalume wetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Lekeni ghumnzabibu ghwidika, ‘Angu ndeke isang'ano yangu ya ukweleka nzabibu itsilapfa dipfai, inogheletsa milungu na iwanu, ng'ende nikawe mfalume wa mibiki?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Baho imibiki yose ighulongela mbiki ghwa mihonga, ‘Utse uwe mfalume wetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Ghumbiki ghwa mihonga ghwidika apfino, ‘Ka mwobama ghendo kunisaghula niwe mfalume wenu, mtse mkale hasi ha ichimbeho changu. Lekeni ka ng'ambama ukutenda apfo ghumoto ghulawe mna imihonga yangu na kuilakatsa mieleletsi ya Lebanoni.’”<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />Yotamu kaghendelela kulonga, “Apfo mwakona chamtendile chotogholighwa na chinogha ahala hamumsaghule Abimeleki yawe mfalume? Na mwakona mumtendela ghanoghile Yeru Baali na iwanu wake, kwa aghala ghayatendile? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Mkumbuke ka aba wangu tsakawatowela mwemwe, tsakelapfa yafe ili yawakombole mwemwe kulawa kwa Wamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Lekeni leloli muwatowa iwanu wa ikaye ya aba wangu na kuwakoma iwanaghe sabini mchanya mwa bambalawe limwe, kuya mumtenda Abimeleki imwana wa ipinga wake wa kunze yawe mfalume wa iwanu wa Shekemu kwaapfila ka ndughu yenu. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Apfo ka mwakona mutnda apfo kwa ghumoyo ghunoghile na kwa kumtoghola Yeru Baali na iwanu wa ikaye yake, lelo deng'eleleni hamwe na Abimeleki, naye yadeng'elele namwe. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Lekeni ka si pfipfo baye, ghumoto ghulawe kwa Abimeleki ghuwalakatse iwanu wa Shekemu na Beti Milo, pfipfila ghumoto ghulawe kuna mwemwe iwanu wa Shekemu na Beti Milo ghumlakatse Abimeleki.” <verse eid="JDG 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Kuya Yotamu koka, katsumila Beeri, kakala kuko kwaapfila yang'ali yompfuka indughu yake Abimeleki.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Apfo Abimeleki tsakawalongotsa iwanu wa Isiraeli kwa miyaka midatu. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Kuya Imulungu kawatenda iwanu wa Shekemu na Abimeleki wesonge, nawo iwanu wa Shekemu wambiduka Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Imulungu katenda apfino ili kuliha ukukomighwa kwa iwana sabini wa Yeru Baali, ikutendighwe na Abimeleki na iwanu wa Shekemu iwamwapfile Abimeleki kuwakoma ndughu tsake.<verse eid="JDG 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Iwanu wa Shekemu waweka iwanu mna ipfidanando pfa ipfidunda wawapfisile na kuwaboka pfinu pfawo iwanu iwobita mnzila, lekeni Abimeleki kahulika imbuli ayo.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Kuya Gaali mwana wa Ebedi kaghenda na ndughu tsake kukala Shekemu, na wanu wa Shekemu wamhuwila yeye. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Wose walawa waghenda mna imighunda yawo ya minzabibu, wabawa nzabibu tsawo na watsikama walapfa dipfai. Kuya watenda chihungo mna ing'anda ya mulungu wawo, waja na kunwa na wamlighita Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Pfipfila Gaali imwana wa Ebedi kalonga, “Angu Abimeleki nani? Na twetwe wanu wa Shekemu tsina nani mbaka tumsang'anile yeye? Angu si mwana wa Yeru Baali baye, na Zebuli si mkulu wake baye? Lelo mwemwe wasang'anileni wanu wa Amori, aba wake Shekemu. Lekeni twetwe heule tumsang'anile Abimeleki? <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Ka ning'awile mkulu wa iwanu awano, ning'amuwingile Abimeleki. Ning'amlongele apfino, ‘Abimeleki wongetse wanu wako wa ing'ondo, kuya ulawe kunze twitowe.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Zebuli mkulu wa ghumji hayahulike ghayalongile Ebedi, kona maya. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Naye kawatuma wanu chinyelenyele waghende kwa Abimeleki ako Toma wakalonge, “Gaali mwana wa Ebedi na ndughu tsake wengila mna isi ya Shekemu na wowasongeletsa iwanu mna ghumji wakuhile ghweghwe. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Apfo lelo ghweghwe na wanu wako nechilo muye mumbete kwa kwipfisa mna imighunda. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Pfipfila nemitondo litsuwa halitsolawa mghende mkaghutowe ghumji aghwo. Gaali hayolawa na wanu wake kutsa kwitowa na mwemwe, uwatowe ka pfaudaha.”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Apfo nechilo Abimeleki na iwanu wake walawa woka. Kawaghola iwanu wake wakale makingili mane, nawo tsawepfisa mna imighunda habei na Shekemu. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Abimeleki na iwanu wake hawamwonile Gaali kolawa kunze, na kema hana lilango lya ghumji, Abimeleki na iwanu wake iwakalile naye walawa hanu ahala hawepfisile. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Gaali hayawonile iwanu awo, kamlongela Zebuli, “Ulole iwanu wohulumka kulawa mna ipfidanando pfa ipfidunda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 9:36">Naye Zebuli kamlongela, “Chaukona ghweghwe masisila gha ipfidunda na si wanu baye.”<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Lekeni Gaali kalonga keli, “Ulole iwanu wolawila haghatighati ha isi, na iwanu wamwenga wakutsa kubitila nzila ya ghumbiki ghwa mwaloni ghwa walaghutsi.”<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Kuya Zebuli kamlongela, “Ukwighoda kwako lelo kulikwani? Angu si ghweghwe baye yulongile, ‘Abimeleki nani? Na hebali tumsang'anile yeye?’ Lelo awo wawo wauwabetsile, ghenda uketowe nawo.” <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Apfo Gaali kalawa, kawalongotsa iwanu wa Shekemu kwitowa na Abimaleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Lekeni Abimaleki kamuwinga Gaali, na wanu wengi walaghighwa na waghwa mnzila mbaka hana lilango lya ghumji. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Abimeleki tsakakala Aruma, naye Zebuli kawawinga Gaali na ndughu tsake walawe woke mna isi ya Shekemu.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Ilupfi yake, Abimeleki kahulika ka iwanu wa Shekemu waghenda kuna imighunda. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Apfo kawasola iwanu wake, kawaghola mna makingili madatu, nawo wepfisa mna imighunda. Hayawonile iwanu wolawa mna imiji, kenuka akula kwayepfisile kaghenda kuwakoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Abimeleki na kingili lyake watsuma, waghenda kulibetetsa lilango lya ghumji, na ghamakingili meli ighasighale waghenda wawatowa iwanu iwakalile kumighunda na kuwakoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Abimeleki tsaketowa na iwanu iwang'ali wokala mna ghumji aghwo misi yose, mbaka hayaghusolile na kuwakoma iwanu wake. Kuya kaghulakatsa kwa moto ghumji aghwo na kughughela mkele.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Iwanu wose iwakalile mna ghumnala ghwa Shekemu hawahulike apfo, watsumila mna imibanda ya ing'anda ya imulungu iyakemighwe Eli Beriti. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Abimeleki kahulika ka iwanu iwakalile mna imibanda ya Shekemu wetingana hamwe. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Apfo Abimaleki na iwanu wake wagheluka mna ichidunda cha Salimoni, na kasola hoya kaghana putila limwe, kalika mna liyegha lyake. Kuya kawalaghitsa iwanu wake wasumke ukutenda ka pfayatendile yeye. <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Apfo chila yumwe kaghana putila ka liyaghanile Abimeleki. Na wasola maputila ghawo wagheka mna ubanda utsunguluka ghumji, wabwina ghumoto na kuilakatsa imibanda mikulu itsunguluka ghumji na iwanu wose wa imibanda ya Shekemu wafa. Apfo iwanu wose iwafile wamale na wapinga tsawapetighwa wapfika elufu imwe.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Kuya Abimeleki kaghenda Tebezi, kaghutsunguluka ghumji aghwo na kughusola. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Lekeni mghati mwa ghumji aghwo tsakuna mnala ghubabale. Iwanu wose wamale na wapinga tsawatsumila kuko, wehindila mghati na wadina mchiswili mwa ghumnala aghwo. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Abimeleki kaghenda kuna ghumnala na kughutowa, kuya kaghusoghelela ghumlango ghwa ghumnala ili yaghulakatse kwa moto.<verse eid="JDG 9:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />Lekeni pinga yumwe kamwasila Abimeleki libwe lya ukusaghila mwitwi mwake, nalyo limtowa na kuhonda litwi lyake.<verse eid="JDG 9:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Baho Abimeleki kamkema imsongolo wake iyadutile tsisilaha tsake, kamlongela, “Usole limaghe lyako unikome, hela iwanu watsolonga nikomighwa na ipinga.” Imsongolo ayo kasola limaghe lyake kamhoma na kumkoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Waisiraeli hawonile Abimeleki kafa, chila munu koka ukaye yake.<verse eid="JDG 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Apfi pfipfo Imulungu pfayamuyitsile Abimeleki kwa aghala ighehile ghayamtendele aba wake, ahala hayawakomile ndughu tsake sabini.<verse eid="JDG 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Pfipfila Imulungu kawaliha iwanu wa Shekemu kwa aghala ighehile ghawatendile. Apfo lighito lya Yotamu mwana wa Yeru Baali liwapfika.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s">Tola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Hayafile Abimaleki, kalawila Tola mwanaghe Pua, na mtsukulu wa Dodo, wa likabila lya Isakari, yawakombole Waisiraeli. Tola tsakakala Shamiri mna isi ya ipfidunda pfa Efuraimu. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Yeye tsa mlamtsi wa Isiraeli kwa miyaka ishilini na midatu, kuya tsakafa na katsikighwa kuko Shamiri.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yairi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Hayafile Tola, Yairi munu wa Gileadi kawa mlamtsi wa Waisiraeli kwa miyaka ishilini na mili. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Ayo tsakana wana wamale selasini iwang'ali wodina pfihongwe selasini. Pfipfila tsawana miji selasini mna isi ya Gileadi, na mbaka leloli yokemighwa Hawoti Yairi, mana yake miji ya Yairi. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Yairi tsakafa na katsikighwa kuko Kamoni.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yefta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Waisiraeli tsawamtendela keli ghehile IMNDEWA Imulungu, waitambikila imilungu ya Baali, imilungu ya Ashitoreti, imilungu ya Aramu, imilungu ya Sidoni, imilungu ya Moabu, imilungu ya wana wa Amoni, na imilungu ya Wafilisti, nawo wamleka IMNDEWA Imulungu na wala ng'awamsang'anile baye. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Apfo IMNDEWA Imulungu kawonela maya Waisiraeli, kawautsa na kawatenda watowighwe na Wafilisti, na Waamoni. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Nawo wawatsupfa na kuwadununza Waisiraeli iwakalile Gileadi mna isi ya Waamori ili ubali wa mashariki ya ghumto ghwa Yoridani kwa miyaka kumi na minane. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Waamoni nawo tsawaloka ghumto ghwa Yoridani kwitowa na makabila gha Yuda, Benjamini na Efuraimu. Na Waisiraeli tsawaghanzika ng'ani.<verse eid="JDG 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Apfo Waisiraeli wamlilila IMNDEWA, walonga, “Tukutendela ghehile, kwaapfila tukuleka Imulungu wetu na tuitambikila milungu ya Baali.” <verse eid="JDG 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Naye IMNDEWA kawalongela, “Angu nene siwakombole baye kulawa kwa Wamisiri, Waamoni, Waamori na Wafilisti? <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />Wasidoni, Waamaleki na Wamidiani, wawo tsawawatsupfa, namwe mndilila nene. Angu nene siwakombole baye kulawa mna ghamoko ghawo? <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Lekeni mwemwe mndeka na muitambikila milungu ingi, apfo sitsowakombola keli baye. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Mke mkaililile imilungu yamuisaghule. Ilekeni iwakombole ahala mwemwe hamtsoghaya.”<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Lekeni Waisiraeli wamlongela IMNDEWA, “Twetwe tutenda nzambi, ututende pfopfose pfaubama, lekeni leloli twokulomba utukombole.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Nawo wayasa na kuileka ghendo imilungu ingi ikalile mna wawo, nawo wamtambikila keli IMNDEWA. Naye IMNDEWA ng'abamile baye ukwona keli maghayo gha Waisiraeli.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Kuya Waamoni wetingana hamwe, weka indalo yawo ako Gileadi. Nawo Waisiraeli wetingana hamwe na weka indalo yawo ako Mizipa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Kuko pfilongotsi wa iwanu wa Gileadi weghutsa wawo kwa wawo, “Yuhi yatsolongola kwitowa na Waamoni? Iyatsotenda apfo, ayo yuyo iyatsowalongotsa iwanu wose iwokala Gileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Lelo ako Gileadi tsakuna munu iyadahile kwitowa ng'ondo iyakemighwe Yefta, mwana wa pinga yumwe chiweghe, na aba wake kakemighwa Gileadi. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Mwehe wake Gileadi pfipfila kamwelekela wana wangi. Iwana wa mwehe ayo hawakulile, wamuwinga Yefta yoke ukaye yawo, wamlongela, “Ghweghwe ng'utsopata chinu chochose baye kulawa kwa aba wetu, kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa mwana wa pinga wa kunze.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Apfo Yefuta katsuma kawaleka ndugu tsake kaghenda kukala mna isi ya Tobu. Kuko wanu mbughilambughila wetingana naye, waghenda naye.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Matsuwa chidogho hambele, Waamoni watsa kuwatowa Waisiraeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Hailawile apfo, wakulu wa Isiraeli waghenda kumsola Yefta kulawa isi ya Tobu. <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />Wamlongela, “Utse utulongotse hatwitowa na Waamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Lekeni Yefuta kawalongela, “Angu si mwemwe baye yamnihile na kuniwinga ukaye kwa aba wangu? Lelo mwonitsila kwaapfila mwoghaya?”<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Iwakulu awo wa Gileadi wamlongela, “Acho chicho chitutendile mbaka tutsa kuna ghweghwe ili tuke naghwe ukatwapfile ukwitowa na Waamoni, naghwe kutsotulongotsa twetwe na iwanu wose wa Gileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Yefuta kawalongela, “Ka mng'ambuyitsa ukaye nighende na mwemwe niketowe na Waamoni, naye IMNDEWA yang'anyapfila kuwatowa, pfihi nitsakuwa chilongotsi wenu ghendo?”<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Wakulu wa Gileadi wamwidika, “IMNDEWA katsakuwa mkalangama wetu. Na twetwe tutsotenda ka pfaulongile.”<verse eid="JDG 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Apfo Yefuta kaghenda nawo, nawo wamtenda yawe chilongotsi wawo, na ako Mizpa koyila keli ukughalonga hambele ha IMNDEWA aghala ghose ghayalongile na iwakulu.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Baho Yefuta katuma wasenga waghende kwa mfalume wa Waamoni kamlongela, “Una choni na twetwe mbaka utse witowe na iwanu wa isi yetu?” <verse eid="JDG 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Imfalume wa Waamoni kawedika iwasenga awo iyawatumile Yefta, “Waisiraeli hawalawile Misiri, wasola isi yangu kulawa Arinoni mbaka Yaboki na ghumto Yoridani. Lelo mbuyitsile isi yangu bila ukwisonga.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Yefta katuma keli wasenga waghenda kwa mfalume wa Waamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />Wamlongela, “Yefta kolonga apfino, ‘Waisiraeli ng'awaisolile baye isi ya Moabu wala isi ya Waamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Lekeni Waisiraeli hawalawile Misiri, wang'ila mnyika mbaka kuna ibahari ya Shamu mbaka Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Kuya Waisiraeli watuma wasenga waghende kwa mfalume wa Edomu, wamlomba yawaleke wapfose mna isi yake, lekeni mfalume wa Edomu kalema. Apfo wamlomba mfalume wa Moabu, naye pfipfila kalema. Apfo Wasiraeli wakala mna isi ya Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Pfipfila wabitila mnyika na kuitsunguluka isi ayo ya Edomu na isi ya Moabu, mbaka wapfika ubali wa mashaliki wa isi ya Moabu. Kuya weka ndalo kumwambu kwa ghumto Arinoni. Lekeni ng'awengile baye mna isi ya Moabu kwaapfila ghumto Arinoni ghugho ghumbaka ghwa isi ya Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Baho Waisiraeli watuma wasenga waghende kwa mfalume wa Sihoni wa Waamori ako Heshiboni wamlomba yawaleke wabite mna isi yake waghende kuna isi yawo. <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Lekeni Sihoni ng'awatogholele baye Waisiraeli wapfose mna isi yake. Apfo Sihoni kawatinganitsa iwanu wake wose, weka indalo ako Yahasa, wetowe na Waisiraeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Naye IMNDEWA Imulungu wa Isiraeli, kawapfila Waisiraeli wamtowa Sihoni na iwanu wake. Apfo Waisiraeli waisola isi yose ya Waamori iwang'ali wokala ako. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Waisola isi yose ya Waamori kulawa ghumto ghwa Arinoni mbaka ghumto Yaboki, pfipfila wasola kulawa kunyika ubali wa mashaliki mbaka ubali wa maghalibi wa ghumto Yoridani. <verse eid="JDG 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Baho IMNDEWA Imulungu wa Isiraeli kawawinga Waamori woke hambele ha Waisiraeli. Pfihi ghweghwe naghwe kobama utuboke isi yetu? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Wenele na achila chayakwing'ile imulungu wako Kemoshi. Lekeni isi yoyose IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu iyawawawingile iwanu wake yatwing'e twetwe, ayo yetu. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Pfii ghweghwe kuna ngupfu kubita Balaki mwana wa Sipori iyakalile mfalume wa Moabu? Angu yeye ng'esongile baye na Waisiraeli au kwitowa nawo? <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Waisiraeli tsawakala mna ghumji ghwa Heshiboni na pfijiji pfake, mna ghumji ghwa Aroeri na pfijiji pfake, na mna imiji yose ikalile mmbalimbali mwa ghumto Arinoni kwa miyaka miya ndatu. Heule ghweghwe ng'uisolile baye mna ghamatsuwa agho? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Nene sitendile totso kuna ghweghwe, lekeni ghweghwe konendela ghehile kwa kwitowa na nene. IMNDEWA yuyo yolamla. Leloli yeye katsakuwa mlamtsi wa Waisiraeli na Waamoni.’” <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Lekeni mfalume wa Amoni kabetsa achila chayalongile Yefta.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Kuya Muhe wa IMNDEWA kamtsila Yefta, naye kaghenda kubitila Gileadi na Manase, koya Mizpa mna isi ya Gileadi, na kawaghendela iwana wa Amoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Yefta kelaha kwa IMNDEWA, kalonga, “Ning'ahuma kuwatowa Waamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />chochose ichitsolawa kunze kulawa mng'anda mwangu kutsa kutingana na nene hanikuya kulawa kwa Waamori waniwatowile, acho chitsakuwa chakwako ghweghwe IMNDEWA. Acho nitsokulapfila chiwe nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa.”<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Apfo Yefta kaloka ghumto kaghenda kwitowa na Waamoni, naye IMNDEWA kamwapfila kawahuma.<verse eid="JDG 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Kawatowa kulawa Aroeri mbaka kupfikila Miniti, na kaghendelela mbaka Abeli Keramimu. Apfo Waamoni watowighwa ghendo na Waisiraeli.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndele wa Yefta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Yefta hayoyile ukaye yake Mizpa, mndele wake kalawa katsa kumbokela aku kopfina na kutowa chighoma. Ayo tsakakala mwanaghe nyalimwe, kahela mwana yungi. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Yefta hayamwonile, kadegha maghwanda ghake kwa usungu kalonga, “Ghwe mwanangu, kunenda mbone usungu, ghweghwe kwa yumwe wa iwanu iwonidununza, nene nilaha kwa IMNDEWA, na sidaha baye kuleka kutenda chanilahile.”<verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Imndele ayo kamlongela, “Ka kwilaha kwa IMNDEWA, unitende achila chawilahile, kwaapfila IMNDEWA kakwapfila kuwatowa Waamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Kuya kamlongela aba wake, “Nokulomba chinu chimwe, ungaye miyetsi mili ng'ende na sale tsangu kuchidunda nikadomboketse kwaapfila nitsakufa ng'ana nikwelighwe.” <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Aba wake kamleka yaghende ako kwa miyetsi mili, naye kaghenda na sale tsake kuchidunda na wadomboketsa kwaapfila katsakufa ng'ana yakwelighwe. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Miyetsi mili haimalile, koya kwa aba wake naye kamtenda ka pfayelahile, naye imndele ayo tsang'awasile baye na mmale wowose. Apfo kulawa aho tsakukala na chihendo achino mna isi ya Isiraeli.<verse eid="JDG 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />Chila mwaka wandele wa Isiraeli wang'ali woghendagha kudomboketsa ukumkumbuka imwanaghe Yefta wa Gileadi kwa matsuwa mane.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Yefuta na likabila lya Efuraimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Iwanu wa Efuraimu wetingana hamwe, waloka ghumto ghwa Yoridani waghenda Zafoni. Kuya wamlongela Yefuta, “Heule ng'autukemile baye tughende hamwe kuwotowa Waamoni? Lelo twoilakatsa ng'anda yako aku ghweghwe kwa mng'anda.”<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Yefuta kawalongela, “Nene na iwanu wangu tung'ali tuwehila sideke Waamoni. Tsaniwakema mnyapfila lekeni mwemwe ng'amtsile baye kunikombola. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Hambonile ng'amkutsa kunyapfila baye, tsanilapfa nife, ndoka niketowe na Waamoni, na IMNDEWA kanyapfila niwatowa Waamoni. Heule lelo mwakutsa kwitowa na nene?”<verse eid="JDG 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Apfo Yefta kawakema wanu wa Gileadi hamwe, waghenda waketowe na wanu wa Efuraimu. Na iwanu awo wa Gileadi wawatowa iwanu wa Efuraimu, kwaapfila wawo tsawalonga, “Mwemwe wanu wa Gileadi mwa wabita nzila iwalawile kuna likabila lya Waefuraimu na kughenda kwa likabila lya Manase.”<verse eid="JDG 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Kuya iwanu wa Gileadi wapfiboka ipfiloko pfa ghumto ghwa Yoridani, ili Waefuraimu waleke kuloka. Chila mbita nzila wa Efuraimu yang'abama yaloke, iwanu wa Gileadi wamghutsa, “Pfii ghweghwe kwa Muefuraimu?” Yang'edika, “Aka,” <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />wolonga pfinogha, “Lelo ulonge Shiboleti.” Lekeni yeye yang'alonga, “Siboleti,” kwaapfila Waefraimu ng'awadahile baye kulilonga ghoya, apfo wamghogha na wamkoma aho hana ipfiloko pfa ghumto ghwa Yoridani. Mna matsuwa agho Waefuraimu elufu alubaini na mbili wakomighwa. <verse eid="JDG 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Yefta tsakawa mlamtsi wa Waisiraeli kwa miyaka sita, kuya Yefta Mgileadi kafa na katsikighwa mna mji ghumwe ghwa isi ya Gileadi.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibizani, Eloni na Abidoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Hayafile Yefta, Ibizani, munu iyolawila Betilehemu kawa mlamtsi wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Yeye tsakana wana wamale selasini na wana wapinga selasini. Wanaghe wapinga awo kawalapfa wakwelighwe na wanu wa kolo tsingi. Pfipfila kawaghalila wanaghe wamale wapinga selasini kulawa kolo tsingi wawakwele. Ibizani kawa mlamtsi wa Isiraeli kwa miyaka saba. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Kuya Ibizani kafa na katsikighwa Betilehemu.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Hayafile Ibizani, munu yumwe taghwa lyake Eloni, yolawila mna likabila lya Zabuloni kawa mlamtsi wa Isiraeli kwa miyaka kumi. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Kuya Eloni kafa na katsikighwa mna ghumji ghwa Aiyaloni ighuli mna isi ya Zabuloni.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Hayafile Eloni, munu yumwe taghwa lyake Abidoni iyali mwana wa Hileli iyolawila mna ghumji ghwa Pilatoni kawa mlamtsi wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Naye tsakana wana wamale alubaini na watsukulu salasini, iwang'ali wodinagha pfihongwe sabini. Naye tsakawa mlamtsi wa Isiraeli kwa miyaka minane. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Kuya Abidoni mwana wa Hileli kafa na katsikighwa mna ghumji ghwa Pilatoni ighuli mna isi ya Efuraimu, mna isi ya pfidunda ya Waamaleki.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Ukwelekighwa kwa Samsoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Waisiraeli wamtendela keli ghehile IMNDEWA, naye kawaleka watawalighwe na Wafilisti kwa miyaka alubaini.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Mna matsuwa agho tsahana munu yumwe taghwa lyake Manoa. Imunu ayo tsakalawa mna ghumji ghwa Sola, na kolawila mna likabila lya Dani. Mwehe wake ng'eleke iwana baye kwaapfila tsamgumba. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Tsuwa limwe Malaika wa Imulungu kamlawila ipinga ayula, kamlongela, “Ghweghwe sambi ng'udaha kweleka wana baye kwaapfila kwa mgumba. Lekeni sambi kutsakuwa na inda, na kutsomweleka mwana mmale. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Lelo walangitse, uleke kunwa dipfai wala mbwali, wala uleke ukuja chijo chochose ichikutenda uleke kutogholighwa na Imulungu. <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />Kwaapfila kutsakuwa na inda na kutsakweleka mwana mmale. Tsimvili tsa imwana ayo tsileke kubehighwa, kwaapfila katsolapfighwa yawe mnatsili wa Imulungu kulawa kwelekighwa kwake, naye katsakwanza kuwakombola Waisiraeli kulawa kwa Wafilisti.”<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Ipinga ayo kaghenda kumlongela mmale wake, “Munu wa Imulungu kanitsila, na chihanga chake chiwa ka malaika wa Imulungu, na chihanga chake cha kukangawatsa. Simghutsile yolawila kwani wala ng'anongele baye taghwa lyake nani. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Lekeni kanongela ‘Kutsakuwa na inda na kutsakweleka mwana mmale. Lelo uleke kunwa dipfai wala mbwali wala uleke ukuja chijo ichikutenda uleke kutoghologhwa na Imulungu, kwaapfila imwana ayo katsolapfighwa yawe mnatsili wa Imulungu kulawa kwelekighwa kwake.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Kuya Manoa kamlomba IMNDEWA, kalonga, “Ghwe IMNDEWA, umtume keli imunu wako yaumtumile yatse yatufunde aghala ghatubamighwa kumtendela imwana ayo iyatsakoneka.”<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />IMNDEWA kamhulika Manoa, na imalaika wa IMNDEWA kamtsila keli ipinga ayo hayang'ali kakumghunda, lekeni Manoa immale wake ng'akalile hamwe naye baye. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Ipinga ayula katsuma himahima, kaghenda kumlongela immale wake, “Lola! Imunu ayula iyanitsile litsuwa alila kandawila keli.”<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Manoa kelongotsa na mwehe wake mbaka wapfika kwa imunu ayo, kamghutsa, “Angu ghweghwe kwa imunu ayula yaulongile na mwehe wangu?” Imunu ayo kalonga, “Ona nene.”<verse eid="JDG 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Kuya Manoa kamghutsa, “Agho ghaulongile haghatsolawila, imwana ayo tutsomtendela choni? Naye yatsotenda ng'onde yachi?”<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Imalaika wa IMNDEWA kamwidika, “Mwehe wako yakinde aghala ghose ghanimlongele. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Yaleke ukuja chinu chochose ichilawa mna mitsabibu, wala yaleke kunwa dipfai, wala kunwa mbwali, wala yaleke ukuja chinu chochose ichimtenda yaleke kutogholighwa na Imulungu. Na ghose ghanimlongele yaghakinde.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Manoa kamlongela imalaika ayo wa IMNDEWA, “Twokulomba ukale chidogho tukuchinjile mwana wa imene.”<verse eid="JDG 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Imalaika ayo wa MNDEWA kamlongela, “Hata ka mwoninanahitsa kukala chidogho, nene sitsakuja baye ichijo chenu. Lekeni ung'abama kulapfa nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa, inambiko ayo mlapfile IMNDEWA.” Manoa tsang'atangile baye ka ayo tsa malaika wa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="JDG 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Baho Manoa kamlongela imalaika ayo wa IMNDEWA, “Taghwa lyako nani, ili haghatsotendeka aghala ghaulongile twetwe tukutunye.” <verse eid="JDG 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Naye kamwidika, “Heule kongutsa taghwa lyangu? Taghwa lyangu lya ukukangawatsa.” <verse eid="JDG 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Kuya Manoa kamsola mwana mene, na nambiko ya usaghe, keka mchanya mwa limbambalawe kamlapfila IMNDEWA. Na imalaika wa IMNDEWA katenda chinu cha ukukangawatsa aku Manoa na mwehe wake wolola. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Apfo Manoa na mwehe wake hawang'ali wolola lilambi lya ghumoto pfalighenda kulanga kulawa ahala hanu ha ukulapfila inambiko, wamwona imalaika wa IMNDEWA koghenda kulanga mna lilambi alyo. Baho Manoa na mwehe wake wenama wamfughamila. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Manoa kamanya ka ayo tsa malaika wa IMNDEWA. Imalaika wa IMNDEWA ng'amlawile keli baye Manoa wala mwehe wake.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Baho Manoa kamlongela mwehe wake, “Twetwe twakufa ghendo kwaapfila tumwona Imulungu.”<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Lekeni mwehe wake kamwidika, “Ka IMNDEWA Imulungu yang'abamile kutukoma, yang'alekile kuitoghola inambiko yetu ya ukulakatsighwa na ya usaghe, na yang'alekile kutulangusa aghano ghose na kutulongela malaghitso aghano.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Kuya mwehe wake Manoa keleka mwana mmale na kamkema Samsoni. Imwana ayo kakula, naye IMNDEWA kambaliki. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Ghumuhe ghwa IMNDEWA Imulungu ghwanza kusang'ana mghati mwake hayakalile ako Mahane Dani haghati ha Sola na Eshitaoli.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni na ipinga kulawa Timna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Litsuwa limwe Samsoni kaghenda kuna ghumji ghwa Timna, kamwona pinga yumwe Mfilisti. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Hayoyile ukaye kawalongela aba wake na mai wake, “Nimwona pinga yumwe mwali Mfilisti ako Timna. Mnikwelele imwali ayo.”<verse eid="JDG 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Aba wake na mai wake wamghutsa, “Pfihi kuduhu pinga wowose mna ndughu tsako au mna iwanu wetu mbaka ughende ukakwele kwa Wafilisti, iwanu ing'awengile ngoma baye?” Lekeni Samsoni kamlongela aba wake, “Mnikwelele imwali ayo, kwaapfila konoghela sideke.”<verse eid="JDG 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Lekeni aba wake na mai wake ng'awamanyile baye ka chinu achi cha IMNDEWA, na IMNDEWA yang'ali yobama ghomba lya ukuwatowela Wafilisti. Kwaapfila matsuwa agho Wafilisti tsawawatawala Waisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Samsoni kahulumka kaghenda Timna, yeye na aba wake na mai wake, na hawapfikile mna imighunda ya mitsabibu ako Timna, baho kwa kwidukitsa kalawila simba mdoghodogho kamdumila Samsoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Baho Muhe wa IMNDEWA kamtsila Samsoni kwa ngupfu, naye kambatsula kwa ghamoko ghake ka imunu yombatsula mwana wa mene. Lekeni ng'amlongele baye aba wake wala mai wake ichinu chayatendile. <verse eid="JDG 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Kuya hawapfikile Timna Samsoni, kaghenda kulonga na imwali ayula, naye imwali ayula kamnoghela Samsoni sideke.<verse eid="JDG 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Matsuwa chidogho haghabitile, koya keli Timna yakamkwele imwali ayo. Hayang'ali ka mnzila kabaghuka hambalimbali kona ghumtsogha ghwa isimba ayula, kumbe tsamna nzukwi wengi na uki mwingi mghati mwa ghumtsogha aghula. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Kabakula uki kwa ghamoko kaghenda yakuja. Hayawapfikile aba wake na mai wake, kaweng'a uki aula, nawo waja. Lekeni ng'awalongele baye ka kasola uki aula kulawa mghati mwa isimba ayula yafile.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Lelo aba wake kaghenda ukaye kwa ipinga ayo. Kuko Samsoni katenda chihungo cha ukuja kwaapfila apfo pfipfo iwamale pfawang'ali wotendagha. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Wafilisti hawamwonile, wamghalila wasongolo wayaghe salasini wadawale naye.<verse eid="JDG 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Samsoni kawalongela, “Leka niwategheni na ng'ungo imwe, ka mng'anongela ing'ungo ayo ilonga choni mna matsuwa saba gha ichihungo, nitsoweng'a maghwanda matselu selasini na maghwanda gha ichihungo selasini. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Lekeni ka ng'amdaha baye kunilongela, mngaye maghwanda matselu selasini na maghwanda selasini gha ichihungo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Wedika walonga, “Haya, tulongele ing'ungo yako na twetwe tuitegheletse.” <verse eid="JDG 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Naye kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">“Kwa iyakuja kulawa chijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">kwa iyana ingupfu kulawa ghumta.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 14:14">Nawo kwa matsuwa madatu ngawadahile baye kuteghula ing'ungo ayo ilonga choni.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Apfo mna litsuwa lya saba wamlongela mwehe wake Samsoni, “Mdedetse mmale wako yatulongele ing'ungo ayo ilonga choni, hela tutsokulakatsa ghweghwe na ng'anda ya aba wako. Angu mtukema ahano mtuboke pfinu pfetu?”<verse eid="JDG 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Mwehe wa Samsoni kamghendela Samsoni aku kolila, kalonga, “Ghweghwe konihila ghendo, ng'unikunda baye. Kuwateghela ng'ungo iwanu wangu na ng'unongele baye ing'ungo ayo ilonga choni.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:16">Samsoni kamwidika, “Hata aba wangu na mai wangu siwalongele, lelo ikuwatse nikulongele ghweghwe?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Naye mwehe wake kalila kwa matsuwa ghose ighasighale mna ghamatsuwa saba gha ichihungo. Mna litsuwa lya saba Samsoni kamlongela mwehe wake, kwaapfila yang'ali yomnanahitsa yamlongele. Naye kawalongela iwanu wake ing'ungo ayo ilonga choni. <verse eid="JDG 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Mna litsuwa lya saba litsuwa ng'ana litsame, iwanu wa ghumji wamlongela Samsoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Chinu chachi chamta kubita uki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">Na yuhi yana ing'upfu kubita simba?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">Naye Samsoni kawedika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Ka ng'amlimile baye na ing'ombe wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">ng'ambamile kutanga baye ing'ungo yangu.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Kuya Ghumuhe ghwa IMNDEWA ghumwingila kwa ngupfu. Kaghenda Ashikeloni, ako kakoma wanu selasini, kuya kasola maghwanda ghawo ghawapfalagha mchihungo, kaweng'a awala iwateghule ing'ungo yake ilonga choni. Kuya koka, kaghenda ukaye kwa aba wake na mai wake aku kaghudubuka. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Na imwehe wa Samsoni keng'ighwa sale yake yamkwele, mna awala iwakemighwe wadawale naye mchihungo.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Hambele chidogho, mna ghumsimu ghwa ukupfuna ingano, Samsoni kasola imene mdoghodogho kamwangila imwehe wake. Kamlongela aba mkwe yake, “Nobama ng'ende kuna ichiheleto cha mwehe wangu.” Lekeni aba wake kamlemela. <verse eid="JDG 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Aba mkwe yake kalonga, “Nene nyaghitsa ghweghwe kumuhila ghendo, apfo nimwing'a sale yako. Lekeni kana mdodo wake, ayo kanogha kubita yeye, umkwele yeye.” <verse eid="JDG 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Samsoni kalonga, “Lelo sambi hanitsowalagha Wafilisti, mleke kumbona nitotsa.” <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Apfo Samsoni kaghenda kaghogha mbweha miya ndatu, kawoha mikila yawo weli weli, keka chiwenge cha ghumoto mna chila mikila ya mbweha weli. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Kabwina ghumoto mna miwenge ayo na kawalekelela wambweha, nawo wengila mna mighunda ya Wafilisti, walakatsa imikinza ya ngano na ingano ila ng'ana ipfunighwe baye, na mighunda ya mizeituni. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Baho Wafilisti waghutsa, “Nani iyatendile apfino?” Wedika, “Ayo Samsoni, tsakatenda apfo kwaapfila ipinga iyamkwelile kulawa Timna aba wake mkwe kamwing'a sale yake.” Wafilisti waghenda wamlakatsa ipinga ayo na aba wake. <verse eid="JDG 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samsoni kawalongela, “Ka mwemwe mtenda apfino, nene nelighita ghendo ka sitsoleka baye mbaka niwoyitsile chamnitendele.” <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Kawatowa ng'ani na kawakoma wanu wengi, kuya kaghenda kukala mna imango ya libambalawe ako Etamu.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samsoni kowahuma Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Kuya Wafilisti wagheluka, waghenda kwika ndalo mna isi ya Yuda, na wenela mbaka habehi na ghumji ghwa Lehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Iwanu wa Yuda wawaghutsa, “Heule mwemwe mtsa kututowa.” Nawo wawedika, “Tutsa kumghogha Samsoni, na kumtenda ka pfayatutendile.” <verse eid="JDG 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Kuya wanu elufu ndatu wahulumka, waghenda kuna imango ya libambalawe ili Etamu. Wamlongela Samsoni, “Pfihi ng'umanya baye ka Wafilisti sambi wotutawala? Angu achi choni chaututendile?” Kawedika, “Niwatendela achila wawo chawanendele.” <verse eid="JDG 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Wamlongela, “Tutsa kukughogha na kukughala ghweghwe kwa Wafilisti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Samsoni kawalongela, “Mwilahe ka mwemwe wenyegho ng'amtsonikoma baye.”<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Wamlongela, “Pfinogha, tutsokwoha hela na kukughala kuna wawo, lekeni ng'atutsokukoma baye.” Apfo wamwoha kwa mitsabi mili ya sambi, na wamlapfa mmango. <verse eid="JDG 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Hayapfikile Lehi, Wafilisti wamghendela aku wotsuma na wokemelela. Baho Muhe ghwa Imulungu kamtenda Samsoni yawe na ngupfu na imitsabi iyohighwe mmoko mwake idumka, iwa ka lutsi pfalulakala mmoto, na imitsabi ayo ilaghala hasi. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Naye kona pate limwe bisi lya ghamatsino gha chihongwe, kalisola na kawakomela wanu elufu imwe. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Kuya Samsoni kawalongela,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:16">“Kwa pate lya chihongwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">ng'oma wanu elufu imwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">kwa pate lya chihongwe niwalundika iwanu iwafile malundolundo.”<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Hayamalitse ukulonga, kalyasa lipate alila, na hanu ahala hakemighwa Lamati Lehi, mana yake chidunda cha pate.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Kuya Samsoni kona ng'ilu, kamlilila Imulungu, kalonga, “Ghweghwe kutwing'a ukombotsi uno kubitila imtumwa wako na sambi nakufa kwa ng'ilu na noghoghighwa na ghamoko gha iwanu ing'awengile ngoma baye.” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Kuya Imulungu katula hanu hana lipondo mna isi ya Lehi, na baho halawa ghamatsi, na hayanwele ingupfu yake imuyila keli. Imbwibwi ayo ikemighwa Eni Hakore nayo yakuko mbaka leloli. <verse eid="JDG 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Samsoni kawa mlamtsi wa Waisiraeli kwa miyaka ishilini mna matsuwa gha Wafilisti hawang'ali wotawala isi.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni ako Gaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Tsuwa limwe Samsoni kaghenda kuna ghumji ghwa Gaza, kuko ketingana na pinga yumwe chiweghe, na kawasa naye. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Iwanu wa Gaza wahulika ka Samsoni tsakakuko, apfo wampfingilila na wang'ali wompfisila hana lilango lya ghumji chilo chose. Wakala tulu ghendo chilo chighima aku wepfikitsa ka wodaha kumkoma hakutsakucha nemitondo. <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Lekeni Samsoni tsakawasa mbaka chilo ghati, kuya kalamka kaghenda kuna lilango lya ghumji, kuko kenula lilango na kalibula hamwe na mikufuli yake, kaiduta na kaghenda nayo kuna ichidanando cha ichidunda ichili habehi na Heburoni.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samsoni na Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Hambele pinga yumwe iyakemighwe Delila kamnoghela Samsoni, ipinga ayo yang'ali yokala mna lwanda lwa Soleki. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Wakulu wa Wafilisti wamghendela Delila, wamlongela, “Umdedetse Samsoni yakulongele tsingupfu tsake nyingi kwatsilawa ili tudahe kumghogha na kumwoha. Ung'atenda apfo, chila yumwe wetu katsokwing'a pfihande selasini pfa fetsa.” <verse eid="JDG 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Delila kamlongela Samsoni, “Dedede Samsoni! Unongele chinu chachi ichikutenda uwe na ngupfu nyingi, na imunu yodahatse kukwoha na kukuhuma?” <verse eid="JDG 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samsoni kamlongela, “Ka wonyoha kwa mitsabi saba mibisi ya minde, nene nakuwa nyondenyonde ka munu wowose ayula.” <verse eid="JDG 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Iwakulu wa Wafilisti wamghalila Delila imitsabi saba mibisi ya minde, naye kamwohela Samsoni imitsabi ayo. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Delila tsakeka wanu wambetetse Samsoni mna ichiheleto ichili mng'anda. Kuya kamkema, “Samsoni, Wafilisti wokutsila.” Lekeni Samsoni kadumla imitsabi ayo ka apfila tsinyutsi pfatsidumka tsing'etingana na moto. Apfo tsingupfu tsake kwatsilawa ng'akumanyike baye. <verse eid="JDG 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Kuya Delila kamlongela Samsoni, “Ghweghwe kunibugha na kungutsukila. Dedede unongele pfaudaha ukwohighwa.” <verse eid="JDG 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Samsoni kamwidika, “Wang'anyoha na mitsabi ya sambisambi, ng'ana yohe chinu baye, nene nakuwa nyondenyode ka munu wowose ayula.” <verse eid="JDG 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Apfo Delila kasola imitsabi ya sambisambi, kamwohela, na kamlongela, “Samsoni, Wapfilisti wokutsila.” Baho tsakuna wanu mna ichiheleto ichili mng'anda wompfisila Samsoni. Lekeni Samsoni kaidumla imitsabi ayo ka pfayodumla utsi. <verse eid="JDG 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Delila kamlongela Samsoni, “Mbaka sambi ung'ali kwonibugha na kwongutsukila. Unongele pfaudaha ukwohighwa.” Samsoni kamlongela, “Ung'asuka tsimvili tsangu tsiwe mabutu saba na ung'aghoha na chitambala, na ung'achikatsa pfinoghile mna ingutso ya kufumila maghwanda, nene nakuwa nyondenyode ka munu wowose ayula.” <verse eid="JDG 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Samsoni hayawasile, Delila kaghasuka hamwe mabutu saba gha tsimvili tsa Samsoni na kaghoha kwa chitambala na kaghakatsa ghendo na libiki Kuya kamlongela Samsoni, “Samsoni, Wafilisti wokutsila.” Samsoni kalamka kulawa mnongo, kaiswekula ingutso aila na chitambala achila. <verse eid="JDG 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Kuya Delila kamlongela, “Udahatse kulonga, nokukunda aku ghumoyo ghwako ng'aghuli hamwe na nene baye? Ghweghwe kunibugha lwakadatu na ng'unongele baye tsingupfu tsako tsilawa kwani.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Delila tsakaghendelela kumtsupfa na kumdedetsa Samsoni kwa kumlongela mbuli tsitso chila tsuwa. Apfo Samsoni kepfa na ghumoyo ghwake ghudeseka chidogho yake. <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />Apfo kalonga ghose ighali mmoyo mwake, kamlongela, “Tsimvili tsangu atsino ng'ana tsibehighwe baye, kwaapfila nilapfighwa niwe wa Imulungu kulawa munda mwa mai wangu. Ning'abehighwa tsingupfu tsangu tsondawa, nene nakuwa nyondenyode ka munu wowose ayula.” <verse eid="JDG 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Apfo Delila hayatangile ka Samsoni kamlongela ghose ighali mmoyo mwake, kawakema wakulu wa Wafilisti, kawalongela, “Mtse lwakeli kwaapfila Samsoni kanongela ichili mmoyo mwake.” Apfo iwakulu wa Wafilisti wamghendela Delila aku wamghalila tsifetsa tsawalongile womwing'a. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Delila kamuwasitsa Samsoni mna ghamafindi ghake, kamkema imunu yatse yamghete ghamabutu aghala ghake saba. Kuya Delila kanza kumdununza Samsoni kwaapfila tsingupfu tsake tsa tsimlawa. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Delila kamlongela Samsoni, “Samsoni Wafilisti wokutsila!” Samsoni kalamka kulawa mnongo aku kaghitsa ka katsolawa na kuswekuka ka pfayatendagha. Kumbe ng'atangile baye ka IMNDEWA kamleka. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Wafilisti wamghogha na wambofula tsinenge, kuya wamghala mna ghumji ghwa Gaza, wamwoha kwa tsimingu tsa shaba, na wamwika yadughedughe usaghe kuna ligeletsa. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Lekeni tsimvili tsa Samsoni tsanza kukula keli tangiya hatsibehighwe.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Samsoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Wakulu wa Wafilisti wetingana hamwe wadeng'elele na wamlapfile tsinambiko mlungu wawo iyokemighwa Dagoni. Lelo wang'ali wakwimba apfino, “Mlungu wetu katwapfila kutughoghela Samsoni, iyotuhila.” <verse eid="JDG 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Imimoyo yawo haing'ali yodeng'elela, walonga, “Mkemeni Samsoni yatse yatutendele midawalo.” Apfo wamlapfa Samsoni kuna ligeletsa, naye kawatendela midawalo, aku wamwika yeme haghati ya tsingutso <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Iwanu hawamwonile Samsoni, wamtunya mlungu wawo, walonga, “Mlungu wetu katwapfila kutughoghela Samsoni, iyotuhila, iyahinyile isi yetu na iyawakomile iwanu wetu wengi.” <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samsoni kamlongela imsongolo ayula iyamkindile ghumoko, “Undeke ng'inde tsingutso itsikindilisa ing'anda aino ili na nene nitsaghamile.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Lelo ing'anda tsaimema wanu wapinga na wamale, iwakulu wose wa Wafilisti tsawabaho. Na kuna ikano tsakuna wanu elufu ndatu wamale na wapinga, wose wang'ali womlolesa Samsoni pfayowatendela imidawalo na kumseka.<verse eid="JDG 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Baho Samsoni kamlomba IMNDEWA, kalonga, “Ghwee IMNDEWA Imulungu, nokulomba ung'umbuke. Ungaye ingupfu mala imwe keli, ghwe Imulungu, mbuyitse chawanendele Wafilisti kwa kutsibofula nenge tsangu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Samsoni katsikinda tsingutso mbili tsa haghatighati itsikindilitse ling'anda lyose, ghumoko ghumwe ngutso imwe, na ghumoko ghwa keli ngutso ingi. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Kuya Samsoni kalonga, “Wime nife hamwe na Wafilisti.” Katsikunughitsa kwa ngupfu tsake tsose, na ing'anda iwaghwila wakulu wose na iwanu wose iwali mng'anda. Apfo iwanu iyawakomile hayang'ali kakufa tsa wa wengi kubita awala iyawakomile hayang'ali kamghima. <verse eid="JDG 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Kuya ndughu tsake na iwanu iwali akaye ha aba wake wahulumka watsa kumsola na wagheluka naye, waghenda kumtsika haghati ha Zola na Eshitaoli, hanu hayatsikighwe Manoa, aba wake. Naye tsa mlamtsi wa Isiraeli kwa miyaka ishilini.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Chinyagho cha Mika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Matsuwa agho tsahana munu yumwe iyang'ali yokala mna isi ya pfidunda pfa Efuraimu iyakemighwa Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Yeye kamlongela mai wake, “Pfihande pfila pha fetsa elufu imwe na miya pfayakwibile imbapfi, nikuhulika ghweghwe komlighita, ulole tsisendi atso ninatso nene, yanitsisolile nene.” Mai wake kamwidika, “Mwanangu, IMNDEWA, Imulungu yakubaliki.” <verse eid="JDG 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Pfipfila kamuyitsila mai wake ipfihande apfo. Mai wake kalonga, “Ili ukulighita kwanilighite kuleke kukupata, nene nopfilapfa ipfihande pfimwenga pfiwe pfa IMNDEWA.” Kuya kamlongela mwanaghe, “Mwanangu, nobama ipfihande apfino pfa fetsa phitengenetsighwe chinyagho cha ukuhongola na chinyagho cha ukulubula. Lelo nene nokuyitsila ipfihande apfo.” <verse eid="JDG 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Apfo kamuyitsila mai wake ipfihande apfo, lekeni mai wake kasola pfihande pfa fetsa miya mbili kamwing'a imunu iyadahile ukulubula ifetsa, naye katenda chinyagho cha ukulubula na chinyagho cha mbiki ichibakighwe ifetsa. Kuya chikighwa mng'anda mwa Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Imunu ayuno Mika, tsakana hanu ha ukutambikila mna ing'anda yake. Tsakatenda pfinyagho pfa milungu yake na chinu chimwe ichikemighwe chitsibaho cha mmambagha, naye kamsaghula imwanaghe yumwe yawe mtambika wake. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Mna matsuwa agho tsakuduhu imfalume mna isi ya Isiraeli, chila munu tsakatenda ka pfayabamile imwenyegho.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Tsahana msongolo yumwe iyolawa mna ghumji ghwa Betilehemu mna isi ya Yuda. Yeye tsa Mlawi iyang'ali yokala na wanu wa likabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Imsongolo ayo kalawa Betilehemu ili muisi ya Yuda kaghenda kubama hanu ha ukukala, apfo kapfika ukaye kwa Mika mna isi ya ipfidunda pfa Efuraimu. <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Mika kamghutsa, “Ghweghwe ulawa kwani?” Naye kamwidika, “Nene na Mlawi, nolawa Betilehemu mna isi ya Yuda, nobama hanu ha ukukala.”<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Mika kamlongela, “Ukale na nene, uwe aba wangu na uwe mtambika wangu, nitsokwing'a pfihande kumi pfa fetsa chila mwaka, na maghwanda gha ukupfala, na ipfijo.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Apfo Imlawi ayo katoghola ukukala na Mika, na Mika kamtenda ka mwanaghe. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Na baho Mika kamhimika Imlawi ayo, kawa mtambika wake, naye kakala ukaye kwa Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Naye Mika kalonga, “Lelo nomanya ghendo ka Imulungu katsonendela ghanoghile, kwaapfila nina Mlawi ka mtambika wangu.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Mika na likabila lya Dani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Mna ghamatsuwa agho Waisiraeli tsawakala wahela mfalume, na mna matsuwa ghagho iwanu wa likabila lya Dani wang'ali webamila isi yawo wenyegho ya ukukala, kwaapfila ng'awadahile baye ukwingila mna isi iwagholelighwe iwe yawo, ka pfaghali ghamakabila ghangi gha Isiraeli. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Apfo iwanu wa Dani watuma wanu watano wana tsingupfu iwolawa Zora na iwolawa Eshitaoli. Iwanu awo walawa mna chila lukolo mna likabila lya Dani, na watumighwa waghende kuipelemba isi ayo. Apfo iwanu awo wapfika mna isi ya ipfidunda pfa Efuraimu, ukaye kwa Mika, wawasa kuko.<verse eid="JDG 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Hawang'ali wa ukaye kwa Mika, watanga apfila pfayolonga imsongolo Mlawi, baho wamhundukila na wamghutsa, “Nani yakughalile ahano? Utenda choni ahano? Heule kwa ahano?”<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Yeye kawedika, kawalongela, “Mika kanyika ahano nimsang'anile, niwa mtambika wake.” <verse eid="JDG 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Wamlongela, “Twokulomba utughutsile kwa Imulungu ka ghumwanza ghwatughenda ghutsonogha.” <verse eid="JDG 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Mtambika ayula kawedika, “Mleke kwalangula chinu chochose, IMNDEWA yuyo iyomlongotseni mna ghumwanza ghwenu.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Iwanu awala watano woka, wapfika Laisha. Wawona wanu iwakalile ako, apfila pfawakalile tseghamba, ka pfawokalile iwanu wa Sidoni. Ng'awolongagha na munu baye wala ng'awakwalangula chinu baye, tsawenela na chila chinu chili muisi. Wakala kutali na Wasidoni na tsawahela mbuli na munu wowose. <verse eid="JDG 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Iwanu awo watano hawoyile Zora na Eshtaoli, ndughu tsawo wawaghutsa, “Ako mwonile choni?”<verse eid="JDG 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Nawo wedika, “Twinuke lelo, tugheluke tukaitowe isi ya Laishi, kwaapfila tuyona isi yawo inogha sideke. Angu lelo chambeta choni? Mleke kupfuka kughenda ako na kuisola isi ayo. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Hamtsopfika ako mtsowona iwanu iwokala tseghamba. Isi ayo ng'ulu sideke na ng'aihungukighwe baye na chinu chochose ichili muisi, na Imulungu kamwing'ani isi ayo iwe yenu.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Apfo wanu miya sita wa likabila lya Dani aku wakinda tsisilaha tsa ng'ondo walawa ako Zora na Eshtaoli waghenda kwitowa. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Wagheluka na wapfika mna ghumji ghwa Kiriati Yearimu, mna isi ya Yuda, na kuko weka ndalo yawo. Apfo pfipfo maghalibi ya Kiriati Yearimu pfahakemighwe Mahane Dani mbaka leloli aino. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Kulawa aho waghenda mna isi ya ipfidunda pfa Efuraimu, na wapfika ukaye kwa Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Iwanu awala watano iwaipelembe isi ya Laishi wawalongela ndughu tsawo, “Apfi mwomanya ka ng'anda imwe mna tsinganda atsino kuna chitsibao cha mmambagha, na chinyagho cha mbiki ichibakighwe fetsa, na chinyagho cha ukulubula, na pfipfila kuna pfinyagho pfingi? Lelo ng'ambe mwomanya cha ukutenda.” <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Apfo waghenda mna ing'anda ya Mika, kwayakalile imsongola Mlawi na wamghutsa yoghendelelatse. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Baho iwanu awala miya sita wa likabila lya Dani, iwadahile kwitowa ghoya wema hana lilango.<verse eid="JDG 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Iwanu awala watano iwaghendile kuipelemba isi wengila mghati na wasola ichinyagho achila, ichitsibao, na ipfinyagho pfingi pfa imilungu. Na aku imtambika ayula kema hana lilango hamwe na iwanu awala miya sita iwakindile tsisilaha tsawo.<verse eid="JDG 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Iwanu awano hawengile mng'anda mwa Mika na kusola ichisibao cha mmambagha na ichinyagho acho ichibakighwe fetsa, na ichinyagho cha ukulubula na pfinyagho pfingi ipfili mna ing'anda aila, baho imtambika kawona, kawaghutsa, “Mtenda choni?”<verse eid="JDG 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Wamlongela, “Nyamala! Uleke kulonga chinu chochose. Tuke wose, uwe aba wetu na mtambika wetu. Angu chihi chinoghile kuna ghweghwe, uwe mtambika wa kabila limwe lya Isiraeli au uwe mtambika wa munu yumwe?” <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Imtambika ayo hayahulike apfo, ghumoyo ghwake ghudeng'elela. Apfo kasola ichitsibao cha mmambagha achila na ichinyagho cha fetsa, na chinyagho cha ukulubula, kuya koka nawo.<verse eid="JDG 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Apfo wahunduka woka aku wawalongotsa iwana wawo na iwanyama wawo na ipfinu pfawo pfose.<verse eid="JDG 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Hawapfikile kutali chidogho kulawa hana ing'anda ya Mika, iwanu awala iwakalile mna tsing'anda itsili habehi na ing'anda ya Mika tsawakemighwa hamwe, nawo wawatsumila mbaka wawapfika iwanu wa likabila lya Dani, <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />na wawakemelela. Iwanu wa likabila lya Dani wahunduka na wamghutsa Mika, “Una choni ghweghwe mbaka kutsa na wanu awano wose?” <verse eid="JDG 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Naye Mika kawedika, “Msola milungu yanihongole na mumsola mtambika wangu na mka naye. Angu nene nina chinu chachi keli? Heule mwongutsa, ‘Una choni?’ ”<verse eid="JDG 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Iwanu wa Dani wamwidika, “Uleke kulonga na twetwe hela iwanu wana imaya watsokutsila na kukukoma ghweghwe na iwanu iwali mkaye mwako.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Apfo wanu wa likabila lya Dani woka, naye Mika hayonile wana bapfu kubita yeye, kahunduka koya ukaye yake.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Wanu wa Dani tsawasola pfinu pfose pfayahongole Mika, na imtambika wake, waghenda Laishi kuna iwanu iwakalile tseghamba. Wawakoma iwanu iwakalile mumo kwa mimaghe na kuilakatsa isi yawo. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Tsakuduhu munu iyawapfile iwanu, kwaapfila tsawakala kutali na wanu wa Sidoni, na tsawahela sale wowose ayula, isi yawo tsaikala mna lwanda lwa Beti Rehobu na wanu wa kabila lya Dani waghutsenga keli ghumji aghwo. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Isi ayo ghumwande ing'ali ikemighwa Laishi, lelo sambi woikema Dani taghwa lya sekulu wawo, yeye tsa mwana wa Yakobu. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Iwanu wa Dani wapfimitsa ipfinyagho apfo ili wapfitamanile, naye Yonasani mwana wa Gerishomu na mtsukulu wa Musa, na wanaghe wawa watambika mna likabila lya Dani mbaka matsuwa aghala iwanu hawaghalighwe kuna utumwa.<verse eid="JDG 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Iwanu wa likabila lya Dani waghendelela kupfitambikila ipfinyagho apfila pfayahongole Mika, matsuwa ghose ahala lihema lya Imulungu halikalile ako Shilo.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Mlawi na pinga wake wa kunze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Matsuwa agho Waisiraeli tsawakala wahela mfalume. Kulawila Mlawi yumwe iyakalile mgheni mna isi ya pfidunda pfa Efraimu, tsakasola pinga wa kunze iyolawa Betilehemu mna isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Lekeni ipinga ayo kamghudubukila Imlawi ayo. Kuya kamleka Mlawi ayo na koya ukaye kwa aba wake ako Betilehemu mna isi ya Yuda, na kakala kuko kwa miyetsi mine. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Kuya mmale wake kaghenda kumuwinza, kabama yakalonge naye ili yoye ukaye. Apfo mmale ayo kaghenda aku kelongotsa na mtumwa wake na wapfihongwe wake weli. Ipinga ayo kambokela, kamwingitsa mng'anda mwa aba wake, na mkwe yake hayamwonile kambokela kwa kudeng'elela. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Kuya mkwe yake, aba wake ipinga ayo, kamkomangitsa yakale, naye kakala kwa matsuwa madatu, waja na kunwa na kawasa kuko. <verse eid="JDG 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Mna litsuwa lya kane, walamka lupfilipfili, keka pfinu pfake ghoya kwa ukuka, lekeni mkwe yake kamlongela, “Tanu uje chijo chidogho upate ingupfu ya ukukila, kuya kodaha kuka.” <verse eid="JDG 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Apfo iwanu awo weli wakala hamwe, wanwa na ukuja, kuya mkwe yake kamlongela Mlawi ayo, “Dedede uwase ahano ichilo chino na ghumoyo ghwako ghudeng'e.” <verse eid="JDG 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Imunu ayula kenuka kabama yoke, lekeni mkwe yake kamkomangitsa yakale, naye kawasa keli kuko. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Kalamka nemitondo tondo mna litsuwa lya tano, kabama yoke, mkwe yake kamlongela, “Uje chidogho, ubete mbaka nemisi.” Apfo wose weli waja chijo hamwe.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Mlawi ayo na ipinga wake na mtumwa wake hawenuke woke, aba wake ipinga ayo, kamlongela, “Ulole lelo, misi imala na nemihe yakwingila, litsuwa liswa, uwase na udeng'e. Ilupfi kutsolamka nemitondotono na kuka ukaye.” <verse eid="JDG 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Lekeni Mlawi ayo kalema kuwasa ako kwa chilo chingi, apfo koka kaghenda Yebusi, mana yake Yerusalemu, kelongotsa na ipinga wake na imtumwa wake na pfihongwe wake weli.<verse eid="JDG 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Hawapfikile habehi na ghumji ghwa Yebusi, litsuwa tsa liswa ghendo, imtumwa ayula kamlongela mtwatsa wake, “Pfinogha ukwingila mna ghumji ghwa Wayebusi na tukawase kuko.” <verse eid="JDG 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Mtwatsa wake kamwidika, “Ng'atuhunduka baye na kwingila mna isi ya wagheni, iwanu iwali si Waisiraeli baye. Tughendelele mbaka tupfike Gibea au Rama.” <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Kalonga, “Tukatsane tupfike Gibea au Rama na tutsowasa mna ghumji ghumwe ghwa imiji aino mili.” <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Apfo waghendelela na ghumwanza ghwao, litsuwa tsa litsama ghendo hawapfikile habehi na Gibea mna ghumji ghwa likabila lya Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Wengila mna ghumji ghwa Gibea ili wawase kuko, na waghenda kukala mna ichibwalu chawetinganilagha iwanu, kwapfila tsakuduhu munu iyawabokele wakawase ukaye yake. <verse eid="JDG 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Nemihe ayo, imnzehe yumwe iyalawile kumghunda tsakabita. Munu ayuno tsakalawa mna isi ya pfidunda pfa Efuraimu, lekeni matsuwa agho yang'ali yokala mna ghumji ghwa Gibea ghwawokala Wabenjamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Naye hayenule tsinenge tsake yalole, kamwona munu mbita nzila kakala mchanza, mnzehe ayo kamghutsa, “Ulawile kwani ghweghwe? Na ughenda kwani?” <verse eid="JDG 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Mlawi kamwidika, “Tulawa Betilehemu ili muisi ya Yuda, na twoghenda isi tsa kutali, isi itsili mna pfidunda pfa Efraimu, tsang'enda Betilehemu ya Yuda na sambi na kuya kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA wangu. Kuduhu munu iyatubokele ukaye yake, <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />hata ka tunacho chila chinu, tunayo imitsani ya ukuja wapfihongwe wetu, na pfighate na dipfai ya ukunwa nene na pinga wangu na mtumwa wangu, ng'atubama chinu chochose baye.” <verse eid="JDG 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Mnzehe ayula kalonga, “Mtse ukaye yangu, na nitsomwing'ani chochose chambama, lekeni mleke kuwasa ahano mchanza.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Kawasola, kawaghala ukaye yake, kaweng'a ichijo wapfihongwe wake. Nawo wahopfugha maghulu ghawo, waja na kunwa. <verse eid="JDG 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Hawang'ali wodeng'elela, wamale wamwenga wehile wa ghumji agho waitsunguluka ing'anda na wagong'onda ghumlango, wamlongela imnzehe yana ing'anda, “Mlapfe kunze immale ayula iyatsile ukaye yako, twobama tuwase naye.” <verse eid="JDG 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Lekeni imnzehe ayo yana ing'anda kalawa kunze kawalonglea, “Baye, sale tsangu, mleke ukutenda chinu acho chihile. Kwaapfila munu ayuno mgheni wangu, mleke kutenda chinu ka achino cha chinyala. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Mlole ahano hana neghe wangu ng'ana yawase na mmale baye, na ipinga wa munu ayuno mgheni, nitsomlapfilani kunze, muwasole na muwatendele ka pfambama. Lekeni imunu ayuno mleke kumtendela chinu acho cha chinyala.” <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Lekeni iwanu ng'awamhulikitse baye. Apfo Mlawi kamsola ipinga wake kawalapfila kunze, wawasa naye na wamtendela pfihile chilo chose, nemitondo wamlekelela yoke. <verse eid="JDG 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Lupfilipfili, ipinga ayula koya ukaye hayakalile immale wake, kaghwa hasi ha ghumlango, kakala baho mbaka hakuchele. <verse eid="JDG 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Mmale wake kalamka nemitondo, kapfughula ghumlango yalawe kunze, yaghendelele na ghumwanza ghwake, baho kamwona ipinga wake kawasa hasi ha ghumlango, ghamoko ghake ghakinda chitsingiti cha ghumlango. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Kamlongela, “Winuke tuke.” Lekeni ipinga wake ng'amwidike chinu baye, apfo kamwinula, kamdinitsa mna chihongwe wake, woya ukaye. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Hayapfikile ukaye yake kasola mmaghe na kamghana ghana ipinga ayo pfihindi kumi na pfili. Kuya kachighala chihande chimwe kwa chila kabila lya isi ya Isiraeli. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Iwanu wose iwonile ichinu acho walonga, “Achi chihulo! Chinu ka achino ng'ana chilawile baye wala koneka tangiya Waisiraeli hawalawile mna isi ya Misiri mbaka leloli aino. Twalangule chinu achi, twighutse na tulamle chaukutenda.”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Wasiraeli weyandaa kwa ing'ondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Wanu wose wa Israeli iwolawa kuna ghumji ghwa Dani mbaka mji ghwa Beeri Sheba na awala iwolawa mna isi ya Gileadi walawa, wawa chinu chimwe na waghenda kwitingana hamwe ako Mizpa, hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Pfilongotsi wose wa ghamakabila gha Isiraeli tsawakala hambele ha mtingano ghwa iwanu we Imulungu, na wose tsawamale wa ng'ondo tsa wa laki nne iwoghenda kwa maghulu na iwakindile mimaghe yawo. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Wanu wa Benjamini nawo wahulika ka Waisiraeli wayao wose wagheluka waghenda Mizipa. Kuya Waisiraeli wamghutsa Mlawi, “Tulongele, ighehile aghano ghalawiletsa?” <verse eid="JDG 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Apfo Mlawi ayula, yana ipinga iyakomighwe kawalongela, “Nene na pinga wangu tsatupfika mna ghumji ghwa Gibea, ighuli muisi mwa wanu wa Benjamini, tukawase kuko. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Lekeni iwanu wa Gibea watsa nechilo waitsunguluka ing'anda yaniwasile, wabama wang'ome nene, wawasa na pinga wangu wa kunze kwa ngupfu mbaka kafa. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Nilusola ilukuli lwa ipinga wangu nimghana pfihande hande, chila chihande nichighala kuna likabila limwe lya isi ya Isiraeli, kwaapfila watenda chinu achino chihile na cha chachinyala mna isi ya Waisiraeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Lelo mwemwe Waisiraeli, mwighutse, na mlonge mtsotenda choni.” <verse eid="JDG 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Iwanu wose wenuka lumwe walonga, “Kuduhu hata yumwe iyatsakuya ukaye yake wala iyakuya kuna lihema lyake, <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />lekeni tutsowatendela iwanu wa Gibea ichinu achino. Tutsolamla kwa kwasa simbi pfatutsowatowa. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Tutsosola wanu kumi mna chila wanu miya wa ghamakabila ghose gha Isiraeli, na wanu miya mna chila wanu elufu imwe, na wanu elufu imwe mna wanu elufu kumi, iwanu awano ng'onde yawo itsakuwa kuwaghalila ichijo maasikali iwowatowa iwanu wa Gibea iwali mna isi ya Benjamini, kwa ichinu chihile na cha chinyala chawatendile mna isi ya Isiraeli.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Iwamale wose wa Isiraeli wetingana hamwe, wose wawa chinu chimwe kwa kughutowa ghumji ghwa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Iwanu wa ghamakabila gha Isiraeli watuma wanu mna isi yose ya likabila lya Benjamini, walonga, “Apfi achi chinu chachi chihile chamtendile? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Lelo muwalapfe wanu awo wa Gibea iwehile ng'ani tuwakome, na tulapfe chinu achino chihile mna Isiraeli.” Lekeni Wabenjamini walema kuwategheletsa ndughu tsawo wana wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Lekeni iwanu wose wa likabila lya Benjamini walawa mna imiji yawo, wetingana ako Gibea, waghende waketowe na Waisiraeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Wanu wa likabila lya Benjamini wawakema hamwe wamale elufu ishilini na sita iwakindile mimaghe iwolawa mna imiji yawo mna litsuwa lilyo, iwodaha kwitowa, na wawasaghula iwanu miya saba kulawa kuna iwanu iwokala Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Mna iwanu awo wose iwasaghulighwe, tsakuna wanu miya saba iwakwasila ghoya ghumoko ghwa kumoso, chila yumwe tsakadaha ukwasa libwe kwa ng'umbewe na kodaha kulenga lupfili lumwe kwa ng'umbewe na kulupata. <verse eid="JDG 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Waisiraeli wawakema hamwe wanu laki nne kulawa mna ghamakabila ghangi kuleka likabila lya Benjamini, iwadahile kwitowa kwa mimaghe.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila ghangi ghowatowa Wabenjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Waisiraeli wagheluka, waghenda hanu ha ukutambikila ako Beteli, kuko wamlomba Imulungu, walonga, “Nani mna twetwe iyatsotulongola kughenda kuwatowa Wabenjamini?” Na IMNDEWA kawedika, “Iwanu wa likabila lya Yuda wawo iwatsolongola.” <verse eid="JDG 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Apfo Waisiraeli woka nemitondo, waghenda kwika indalo habehi na Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Waisiraeli waghenda kwitowa na wanu wa Benjamini, na waweka iwamale wa ing'ondo kulolesa ghumji ghwa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Iwanu wa likabila lya Benjamini walawa kunze mwa ghumji ghwawo ghwa Gibea, wetowa na Waisiraeli, na wawakoma Waisiraeli elufu ishilini na mbili mna tsuwa limwe. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Lekeni Waisiraeli weghuma ngupfu wawo kwa wawo, weika ghoya kwa kwitowa keli na Wabenjamini, bahala hawakalile tsuwa lya kwanza. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Ng'ana watende apfo baye Waisiraeli tanu tsawaghenda hanu ha kumtamanila Imulungu, wamlilila Imulungu mbaka nemihe, wamlomba Imulungu apfino, “Pfii tugheluke keli kwitowa na Wabenjamini ndughu tsetu?” IMNDEWA kawedika, “Mgheluke mketowe nawo.” <verse eid="JDG 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Kuya Waisiraeli wasoghela habehi mna tsuwa lya keli wakawatowe Wabenjamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Mna litsuwa alyo lya keli Wabenjamini walawa Gibea waghenda kuwatowa Waisiraeli wayao, wawakoma Waisiraeli elufu kumi na nane iwadahile kwitowa na mimaghe. <verse eid="JDG 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Iwamale wose wa ing'ondo wa Waisraeli wagheluka Beteli. Wakala kuko aku womlilila Imulungu na ng'awajile chinu baye mbaka nemihe, wamlapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa na nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Waisiraeli wamghutsa Imulungu ako Beteli, kwaapfila lisanduku lya lilaghano tsakuko kwalili mna ghamatsuwa agho. <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />Naye Finehasi, mwana wa Eleazari mtsukulu wa Aruni, tsakakala mtambika. Iwanu wamghutsa Imulungu, “Apfi tugheluke keli twiketowe na Wabenjamini ndughu tsetu?” IMNDEWA Imulungu kawedika, “Ghendani ilupfi nene nitsomwapfilani kuwatowa.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Waisiraeli waweka iwanu wa ing'ondo wepfise na waghutsunguluke ghumji ghwa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Apfo Waisiraeli wagheluka, waghenda kwitowa na wanu wa likabila lya Benjamini mna litsuwa lya kadatu, wema chila munu hanu hake aku woghulolesa ghumji ghwa Gibea, ka pfawalongole kutenda. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Wabenjamini walawa kunze wetowe nawo na wakweghighwa walawe mna ghumji aghwo. Wanza kuwakoma Waisiraeli mna isi ili mwatsi mna nzila ighenda Beteli na inzila ighenda Gibea. Na Waisiraeli iwakomighwe wopfika salasini. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Wabenjamini walonga, “Tuwatowa ka pfatulongole kuwatowa.” Lekeni Waisiraeli walonga, “Twetwe tutsume, tuwakweghe walawe mna ghumji ghwawo watse akuno kuna inzila ng'ulu.”<verse eid="JDG 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Apfo lijeshi kulu lya Isiraeli walawa hanu hawo waghenda kukala keli ako Baali Tamari, na awala iwopfitsia walawa hanu hawo hawakalile wanza kwitowa. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Kuya wanu elufu kumi iwodaha kwitowa pfinoghile iwasaghulighwe kulawa mna ghamakabila gha Isiraeli waghenda kughutowa ghumji ghwa Gibea. Ing'ondo tsaiwa ng'ulu mna litsuwa alyo, lekeni Wabenjamini ng'awamanyile ka ukukomighwa kwao kwa habehi. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />IMNDEWA kawapfila Waisiraeli kuwatowa Wabenjamini, na wawakoma Wabenjamini elufu ishirini na tano na miya imwe mna litsuwa alyo. Wose awano tsawadaha ukwitowa kwa imimaghe. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Na Wabenjamini watanga ka watowighwa kwaapfila Waisiraeli tsawoya kuchughu ka apfila wowatsuma wanu wa Benjamini, ili kuwaleka awala iwepfisile habehi na Gibea wawatowe Wabenjamini.<verse eid="JDG 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli pfawawahumile Wabenjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Iwanu iwepfisile wasumka kutsumila Gibea, wengila mna ghumji na kumkoma chila munu yakalile kuko. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Waisiraeli tsawelaghana na iwanu iwang'ali wepfisa ka wang'atendile chitango, baho hawatsolyona lihosi mlanga ililawa mna ghumji aghwo, waghutowe ghumji aghwo. <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />Na baho iwanu wa kabila lya Benjamini wawakoma Waisiraeli ka selasini, na welongela, “Tuwatowa ka pfatutendagha.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Lekeni halilawile libingu lya hosi mna ghumji, baho wanu wa Benjamini walola kuchughu, wakangawala kwona lihosi mlanga kulawa mna ghumji ghwawo ighung'ali ghulakala. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Baho Waisiraeli wahunduka, na Wabenjamini tsawengilighwa na wogha, kwaapfila watanga ka ukumala kwawo tsakupfika. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Apfo watsumila kunyika, lekeni ng'awadahile baye kuhona. Waghoghighwa haghatighati ha iwanu wa ing'ondo wa Isiraeli, na iwanu wa ing'ondo iwang'ali wolawa kuna ghumji wawakoma. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Wawapfingilila Wabenjamin, na wawawinga mbaka Gibea ubali wa mashariki, aku wowakoma wanu wengi. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Mna litsuwa alyo wanu elufu kumi na nane iwadahile kwitowa pfinoghile wa likabila lya Benjamini wakomighwa. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Wabenjamini wangi iwasighale watsumila kunyika kuna libambalawe lya Rimoni, na Waisiraeli wawakoma wanu elufu tano hawang'ali wa mnzila wotsuma. Waisiraeli waghendelela kuwawinga Wabenjamini iwasighale mbaka Gidomu na kuko wawakoma wanu wangi elufu mbili. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Mna litsuwa alyo Wabenjamini elufu ishilini na tano iwadahile kwitowa na mimaghe wakomighwa. Awano wose tsawakubuhu mna ukwitowa.<verse eid="JDG 20:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Lekeni wanu miya sita wa likabila lya Benjamini watsumila kunyika kuna libambalawe lya Rimoni, na wakala kuko miyetsi mine. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Waisiraeli wawoyila keli Wabenjamini iwasighale na wawakoma kwa limaghe wamale, wapinga, iwana na wanyama wawo, na imiji yose yawaipfikile wailakatsa kwa moto.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">Wabenjamini wakwing'ighwa mapinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Wanu wa Isiraeli tsawelighita ako Mizipa, walonga, “Kuduhu munu wowose mna twetwe iyatsomlapfa mwanaghe yakwelighwe na iwanu wa likabila lya Benjamini.” <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Apfo Waisiraeli waghenda ako Beteli kulomba, wakala kuko mbaka nemihe, wakemelela na wamlilila Imulungu kwa usungu. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />Walonga, “Ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, heule chinu chino chiwalawila Waisiraeli? Heule likabila limwe lyakwagha leloli mna Isiraeli?”<verse eid="JDG 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Ilupfi iwanu walamka nemitondo tondo, watsenga matsabahu, na baho walapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa na nambiko tsa ukukala tseghemba. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Kuya Waisiraeli weghutsa, “Angu kuna wanu mna ghamakabila gha Isiraeli ng'awaghendile baye kudando kuna ghumtingano ghwe IMNDEWA ako Mizpa?” Kwaapfila tsawelighita ka kuna munu ng'aghendile baye kuna ghumtingano ghwe Imulungu ako Mizpa, ayo katsokomighwa. <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Lekeni Waisiraeli wawonela libatsi ndughu tsawo Wabenjamini, walonga, “Leloli Waisiraeli waghitsa kabila limwe. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Lelo tutsotenda choni ili Wabenjamini iwakalile waghima wapate mapinga? Kwaapfila tsatwilaha kwa IMNDEWA ka ng'atutsowalapfa baye wana wetu wakwelighwe nawo.” <verse eid="JDG 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Kuya weghutsa, “Angu kuna wanu mna ghamakabila gha Isiraeli ng'awaghendile baye kuna ghumtingano ghwa IMNDEWA ako Mizpa?” Baho tsawatanga ka kuduhu munu iyalawile Yabeshi Gileadi iyaghendile kuna mtingano agho. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Waisiraeli hawapetighwe ako Mizpa, tsakuduhu munu wowose iyaghendile ako kulawa Yabeshi Gileadi.<verse eid="JDG 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Apfo mtingano aghwo ghwa Waisiraeli ghutuma wanu elufu kumi na mbili, iwadahile kwitowa ng'ondo, na wawalaghitsa apfino, “Mghende Yabeshi Gileadi, mkamkome kwa limaghe chila munu iyokala kuko, wakomeni wapinga na iwana. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Mkatende apfino, wakomeni wamale wose na chila pinga iyawasile na mmale.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Nawo wawona mapinga miya nne yang'ana wawase na mmale iwakalile mna iwanu wa Yabeshi Gileadi. Wawasola wawaghala kuna indalo ako Shilo mna isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="JDG 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Kuya ghumtingano ghwose ghwa Waisiraeli ghutuma nume ya ukukala tseghamba kwa Wabenjamini iwakalile kuna libambalawe lya Rimoni. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Wabenjamini bahala woya, weng'ighwa mapinga awala yang'awana wawase na mmale wa Yabeshi Gileadi iwalekighwe kukomighwa. Lekeni wapinga awo ng'awawenele baye.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Waisiraeli wawonela libatsi Wabenjamini, kwaapfila IMNDEWA kalileka likabila limwe chidogho lihupe mna ghamakabila agho gha Isiraeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Na wakulu wa ghumtingano aghula walonga, “Lelo tutendetse ili tuweng'e iwamale iwalihela wapinga kwaapfila wapinga wose wa likabila lya Benjamini wakomighwa?” <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Iwamale wa likabila lya Benjamini, iwalekighwe kukomighwa wobamighwa weng'ighwe wapinga, ili weleke wana likabila lighendelele, apfo kuleke ukwagha kwa likabila limwe mna Isiraeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Lekeni ng'atudaha baye kuwaleka wawakwele wana wetu, kwaapfila tsatwilaha apfino, “Katsolighitighwa imunu ayula iyomlapfa imwanaghe yakwelighwe na Mbenjamini.”<verse eid="JDG 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Baho walonga, “Lola, ichihungo cha IMNDEWA ichitendekagha ako Shilo chila mwaka ng'ambe cha habehi.” Ghumji agho ghwa Shilo tsa ghwa kasikazini mwa Beteli, ubali wa mashaliki kuna inzila ng'ulu ilawa Beteli kughenda Shekemu, kusini mwa Lebona. <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Apfo wawalaghitsa Wabenjamini wamale apfino, “Mghende mkepfise mna imighunda ya mitsabibu. <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />Mkale meso, iwandele wa Shilo hawolawa kunze kupfina kuchihungo, mwemwe mlawe mna imitsabibu na chila munu yasole kwa ngupfu mndele yumwe yawe mwehe wake. Kuya muye mna isi ya Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Aba tsawo na ndughu tsawo hawatsakutsa kutughutsa twetwe tutsowalongela, ‘Twowalomba muwonele libatsi iwanu wa Benjamini na muwaleke wawasole wapinga awo, kwaapfila ng'atuwasolele baye chila munu mwehe wake kulawa kung'ondo. Namwe ng'amtsakuwa na totso baye kwaapfila ng'amuwalapfile wenyegho baye iwanenu wakwelighwe nawo.’” <verse eid="JDG 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Apfo pfipfo pfawatendile Wabenjamini, iwandele hawang'ali wopfina, chila mmale kesaghulila mndele yumwe na kamsola yawe mwehe wake. Kuya woya mna isi yaweng'ighwe na watsenga miji yawo keli na kukala mumo. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Mna matsuwa agho Waisiraeli woya, chila munu koya kuna likabila lyake na kuna ilukolo lwake, na kuna isi yake. <verse eid="JDG 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Matsuwa ghagho Waisiraeli wakala wahela mfalume, apfo chila munu katenda ka pfayonile pfinogha.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>